<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Bondei Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbui Yedi inga yekuandikwayo ni Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbui Yedi yekuandikwayo ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matayo</para>
  <para style="imt1">Uwoongoezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbui yedi ekuandikayo Matayo ni mwenga aho ya vitabu vine mwe Diagane Dihya. Vigombekavyo ugima wa Yesu Klistu, kia kimwe cha kitabu icho chetangwa, “Mbui Yedi.” Ziandikwa bada ya ufe wa Yesu, na Matayo na Maliko na Luka na Yohana. Wamanyisi khawamanya Talehe kuwa ni ini Matayo nee kaandika Mbui Yedi inu, Iya yadahika iyandikwa mwe myaka makumi mtandatu bada ya kuvyaigwa Yesu Klistu. Naho hantu ambaho iyandikwa khahamanyika iya wantu wangi wamamaakhanya kuwa iyandikwa uko Palesitina, yadahika ni kwe mzi wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muandikaji wa kitabu iki ni Matayo ambae nee kawa mtoza ushuu, kabla Yesu khazati kumwetanga awe mhina wakwe. Viyaviya nee akamanyika kwa zina da Lawi. Matayo nekawa wamwe na wamwe wa wagiiwa Yesu kumi dimwe na mbii na nee kawaandikia wasomaji wa Kiyahudi. Inu yaoneka pwii inga ekuuwiiavyo mbui zaidi makumi mtandatu kulawa mwe Diagane da kae. Kakunda koonyesha kuwa Yesu nee Klistu, mwohozi ekusagulwaye ni Muungu ambae waoni wamtamwiizia mbui zakwe. Matayo kaandika mangi yahusuyo Useuta wa Muungu, Wayahudi nee wakamkauwiya Klistu ambae endaawe Seuta wa kisiasa. Matayo ahigana mbui iyo vitana kwa kugombeka mbui za Useuta wa Muungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbui Yedi ya Matayo ni kitabu kitana cha kuvokea kusoma mwe Diagane Dihya, kwaajii vitumia vifungu kulawa mwe Diagane da kae, kitabu iki chatoza maagane maidi. Matayo kageeza kutongea msimo wa vitabu vya Musa, ambavyo ni vitabu vishano vya bosi vya Diagane dakae. Mabiikizi ya Yesu kwe muima, ambayo yapatikana mwe kitabu cha Matayo 5-7 yadaha kuiganizwa na hada ambaho Muungu ekuwaho amwekha Musa miko, kumbukizi da miko 19:3; 23:33.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeumondani</para>
  <para style="io">1 Matayo aivoka Mbui Yedi kwa kugombeka kuusu kuvyaigwa kwa Yesu Klistu na Yesu ekuvoka ndima yakwe mwe chando cha 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Uyu Matayo agombeka ndima ya Yesu na mahinyo mangi ekuhinyayo mwe chando cha 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io">Hantu ha kisikiizi ha kitabu cha Matayo yagombeka mbui khuu muno ya ndima ya Yesu mwe ufe wakwe na kuyuyuka kwakwe mwe chando cha 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Kolwa da Yesu Klistu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Kitabu cha mazina ya wantu wa kolwa da Yesu Klistu mwana Daudi mwana wa Ibulahimu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibulahimu nekamvyaa Isaka na Isaka akamvyaa Yakobo na Yakobo akamvyaa Yuda na wanduguze. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda akamvyaa Pelesi na Zela, ambao mami yao nee ni Tamali, Pelesi akamvyaa Eziloni na Hesiloni akamvyaa Alamu. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Alamu akamvyaa Aminadabu na Aminadabu akamvyaa Nashoni na Nashoni akamvyaa Salimoni. <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni akamvyaa Boazi, na mami yakwe Boazi nee ni Lahabu, na Boazi akamvyaa Obedi, na mami yakwe Obedi nee ni Luti, na Obedi akamvyaa Yese. <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Nae Yese akamvyaa Seuta Daudi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Daudi akamvyaa Selemani, mami yakwe Selemani ni yuda ekuwae mkaza Ulia. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Selemani akamvyaa Lehoboamu na Lehoboamu akamvyaa Abiya na Abiya akamvyaa Asa. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa akamvyaa Yehoshafati na Yehoshafati akamvyaa Yolamu na Yolamu akamvyaa Uzia. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia akamvyaa Yosamu na Yosamu akamvyaa Ahazi na Ahazi akamvyaa Ezekia. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Ezekia akamvyaa Manase na Manase akamvyaa Amoni na Amoni akamvyaa Yosia. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia akamvyaa Yekonia na wanduguze. Kisingi cha kusamizwa kwa Wayahudi kuita si ya Babeli.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Bada ya kusamizwa na kuita mwe si ya Babeli, Yekonia akamvyaa Shealitieli na Shealitieli akamvyaa Zelubabeli. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zelubabeli akamvyaa Abiudi na Abiudi akamvyaa Eliakimu na Eliakimu akamvyaa Azoli. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azoli akamvyaa Sadoki na Sadoki akamvyaa Akimu na Akimu akamvyaa Eliudi. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi akamvyaa Eliazali, na Eliazali akamvyaa Matani na Matani akamvyaa Yakobo <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo akamvyaa Yusufu muume da Malia ekuwae mami yakwe da Yesu etangwaye Klistu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Naho kuvokea Ibulahimu adi kubua kwa seuta Daudi, nee kuwa na vivyazi kumi dimwe na nne, naho tangia Seuta Daudi hadi Wayahudi wekudoigwaho kuita Babeli nee kuwa na vivyazi kumi dimwe na nne. Naho kuvokea kisingi wekusamizwaho adi kuvyaigwa kwa Yesu Klistu nee kuwa na vivyazi kumi dimwe na nne.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvyaigwa kwa Yesu Klistu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Naho kuvyaigwa kwa Yesu Klistu nekuwa ivi, Malia mami yakwe ekuwaho kaombwa na Yusufu. Akini kisingi khawazati kuteguana akaoneka ana ifu kwa udaho wa Muye wa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Kwaviya Yusufu, ekuwaye akunda kumtegua Malia nekawa mntu yedi, khekukunda kumgea soni hemeso ya wantu, ivyo akakunda kumbada kwa sii. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ekuwaho akamamakhanya mbui iyo, mndima wa uko uwanga kwa Muungu wa Zumbe akamwawiiya mwe sozi, nakumwamba “Yusufu mwana Daudi wesekuogoha kumdoa Malia atende mkazio mana kenua ifu kwa udaho wa Muye wa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Endaavyae mwana kigosi na wendaumwekhe zina da Yesu, kwa viya yee nee mwendae awaohoe wantu wakwe kulawa mwe mavigaviga yao.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Naho aya yose yalawiiya ili iiganie ida mbui ya Zumbe ekugombekayo kwembokea kwa muoni wa Muungu <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Kauwa mvyee mwenye kiwaa endaenue ifu. Na kuvyaa mwana kigosi, nae endaetangwe Imanueli” mana yakwe, “Muungu hamwe na swie.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Naye Yusufu ekwenukaho mwe usisiza akagosoa inga mndima wa uko uwanga kwa Muungu wa Zumbe ekumwambavyo, akamdoa mkaziwe adi kaya. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Akini khekugonana nae adi Maliamu ekuvyaaho mwana kigosi. Na Yusufu akamwekha zina da Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Wageni kulawa awiyo da zua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu kavyaigwa mwe mzi wa Betilehemu phande ya Uyahudi, kisingi cha ugookezi wa Seuta Helode. Ekuvyaigwaho du, wamanyi wa ntoondo kulawa awiyo da zua wakabua mzi wa Yelusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />wakauza, “Yuhahi mwana, mwekuvyaigwa, endaeawe Seuta wa Wayahudi?, Kwaviya tiiyona ntoondo yakwe yekulawiiyaho awiyo da zuwa na swie teza kumvika.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Seuta Helode ekuyategeezaho ayo, yee na wantu wose wa mzi wa Yelusalemu wakatozwa ni maatu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Naho akawetanga hamwe, waviki wakuu wose na wahinyi wa miko ya Muungu ekumwekhayo Musa akawauza, “Klistu avyaigwa hahi?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Wowo wakamtambaisa, “Avyaigwa mwe mzi wa Betilehemu, uko Uyahudi.” Inga muoni wa Muungu ekuandikavyo,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“ ‘Wee Betilehemu si ya Uyahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Wee khio mdodo katu mwe mizi mikuu ya si ya Yudea</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Kwaviya aho hako endaalawiiye Seuta mwendae awagookee wantu wangu wa Isilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Aho Helode akawetanga kandani awo wamanyi wa ntoondo akawauza, asa kisingi ida ntoondo yekuwalawiiyaho. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Naho akawaagiiya waite mwe mzi wa Betilehemu akawamba, “Hitani mkasunguumanye kwa vitana mbui za mwana uyo, mkabinda kumanya mbui zakwe niyeteani mbui zakwe na miye niite nikamvike.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Wekubindaho kumtegeeza seuta, awo wamanyi wa ntoondo wakahauka, wakaongweewa na ida ntoondo wekuiyonayo awio da zua adi hantu hada hekuwaho yuda mwana, <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Wenye umanyi wekuonaho ida ntoondo igooka nawo wakawa na nyemi muno. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Wakengia mda nyumbani, wakamwona yuda mwana hamwe na Malia mami yakwe wakakinta mavindi, wakamvika. Naho wakavugua sanduku na kulavya funge zao, zahabu na ubani na mzigi kwaajii ya wana wekwetangwao manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Ivyo wakauya mwe si yao kwa sia ntuhu, kwaviya Muungu nee kawahaza mwe sozi wasekuuya kwa Helode.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyiikia Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Wamanyi wa ntoondo wekuhaukaho mndima wa uko uwanga kwa Muungu wa Zumbe akamuawiiya Yusufu mwe sozi akagombeka, “Hauke, mdoe mwana hamwe na mami yakwe mnyiikie Misili. Mwekae uko adi nendaho nikugombeke vituhu, kwaviya Helode aondeza kumkoma uyu mwana.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Ivyo, Yusufu akenuka, akamdoa mwana hamwe na mami yakwe wakahauka na kio akaita Misili. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Akekaa uko hadi Helode ekuuyaho na nyuma mbui iyo igosoka inga ekwambavyo Zumbe kwa sia ya muoni wakwe iiganie, “Khimwetanga mwanangu kulawa Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wateke wakomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helode ekumanyaho wada wamanyi wa ntoondo wamtiiya akakimwa muno. Akaagiiya wana wose wa kigosi wa mzi wa Betilehemu na mizi yose yekuwayo hehi yakwe, kuvokea mwana wa msi umwe adi myaka miidi wakomwe. Bada ya kumanya mbui izo kulawa kwa wada wamanyi wa ntoondo.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Nee yekuiganiaho mbui yekugombekwayo kwa sia ya muoni Yelemia,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Mgutio wa ndio na mabwaimbo vitegeezeka uko Lama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli awaiiya wana wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Nahodu khakunda kugewa moyo kwaviya wose wakomwa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kulawa Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Helode ekuuyaho na nyuma mndima wa uko uwanga kwa Muungu wa Zumbe akamuawiiya Yusufu mwe sozi kuda Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />akamwamba, “Enuka! Mdoe mwana hamwe na mami yakwe, uuye vituhu mwe si ya Isilaeli kwaviya wada wekukundao kumkoma mwana uyo khawana ugima vituhu.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Naho Yusufu ekwenukaho, akamdoa mwana hamwe na mami yakwe akauya mwe si ya Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Akini Yusufu ekusikiaho kuwa Alikelao mwanawe da Helode nekawa seuta wa si ya Yudea hantu hatati yakwe akaogoha kuita uko. Naho bada ya kuemezwa mwe sozi akaita phande za Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />akasamia mwe mzi wetangwao Nazaleti. Nee ivyo yekuiganiavyo mbui zekugombekwazo kwa sia ya Waoni wa Muungu, “Endaetangwe mntu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatiiza abiikia wantu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Misi ziya Yohana Mbatiiza keza akibiikia mwe nyika ya Uyahudi na akigombeka, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Mhitukieni Muungu na mbade mavigaviga yenu kwamana useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu uhehi.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yohana uyu ni yuda mwekutamwiiwaye na muoni Isaya ekwambaho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Mgutio wa mntu wetanga mwenyika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Mgosoeyani Zumbe sia yakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">Nyooshani myemboko yakwe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohana nee kavaa gwanda dekufumwado kwa mazoya ya mnyama etangwae ngamia na mkwiji wa babu mwe kigudi. Khande yakwe neiwa sige na woki. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Naho wantu wakamtimia kulawa mzi wa Yelusalemu, na phande zose za Uyahudi na mizi ya khandakhanda ya zigizigi da mazi da Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Nawo wakagombeka mavigaviga yao na kubatiizwa mwe zigizigi da mazi da Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Akini ekuwaonaho Mafalisayo na Masadukayo wangi wamwezea wakunda kubatiizwa, nee awamba, “Nywie uvyazi wa nyoka! Nindai mwekuwahaza mguuke maya yezayo? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Naho oneshani kwa ntendwa zenu kuwa mumhitukia Muungu na kubada mavigaviga inga mti uvyaao matunda matana. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Naho msekumamakhanya mwe mioyo yenu na kweamba tinae tate ni Ibulahimu. Kwaviya nawamba kwei Muungu adaha kuyagosoa maiwe aya yawe wana wa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Na hoya diikwa kae mwe mazindo ya miti ivyo kia mti wesaokuvyaa matunda matana wendausengwe na kwasigwa mwe moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Miye nawabatiiza kwa mazi kwaviya mhituka na kubada mavigaviga. Akini mwe mgongo wangu eza yee mwenye udaho kusima miye, ambae khikundigwa katu kwenua sabana zakwe. Yee endaawabatiize kwa Muye wa Muungu na kwa moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Ana kiheo mwe mkono wakwe, nae endaahagie hantu ha kuhetea, na kukusanya ngano na kuuika mwe taa na mahehe endaayoke moto wesaokukomeka.” <figure style="fig" file="06 Threshing.jpg" size="col" ref="3:12">Mntu aheta uhemba kulawa mwe kiheo</figure><verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abatiizwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Naho kisingi icho Yesu akalawa mzi wa Galilaya akabua mwe zigizigi da mazi da Yolodani akamtimia Yohana ambatiize. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Akini Yohana akaemea akamba, “Mie asa nemkundigwa nibatiizwe na weye, na weye weza aha hangu nikubatiize!”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Eka iwe ivyo isasa, kwaajii inu nee vyeivyo tikundigwavyo kugosoa yada akundayo Muungu. Aho Yohana akazumiiya.”<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Yesu ekubindaho kubatiizwa akalawa mwe mazi, uwanga kwa Muungu kukavuguka nae akoona Muye wa Muungu ukaseeya inga sua na kugooka uwanga yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Naho mgutio kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu ukagombeka, “Uyu nee mwanangu nimkundisae, anieteaye nyemi khuu.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ageezwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Naho Yesu akegalwa na Muye wa Muungu adi he kiwawe na kugeezwa na ibiisi. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Bada ya kwekaa misi makumi mane kwehiniza kuda kio na musi na kisiikizi akaumwa ni saa muno. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Aho mgeeza akamwezea, na akamgombeka, “Ukawa wee ni Mwana wa Muungu yaagiiye maiwe aya yawe mabumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Iyandikwa mwe Maandiko ya Muungu, ‘Mntu khadaha kwekaa du kwa mabumunda, Iya kwa kia mbui agombekayo Muungu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Naho ibiisi akamdoa adi Yelusalemu mzi wa Muungu akamuika uwanga ya mnaa wa Nyumba ya Muungu, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />akamwamba, “Ikawa wee ni Mwana wa Muungu, etambike asi kwaviya iyandikwa mwe Maandiko ya Muungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Muungu endaawaagiiye wandima wakwe wa uko uwanga weze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Wendawakudoe mwe mikono yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Usekweza kweumiza muundi wako mwe iwe.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu akatambaisa, “Naho iyandikwa mwe Maandiko ya Muungu, ‘Usekumgeeza Zumbe, Muungu yako.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Naho Ibiisi akamdoa adi uwanga ya muima wekulehao, akamwonyesha seuta zose za inusi na ukuu wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Akamwamba, “Ivi vyose nendanikwekhe inga ukanikintia mavindi na kunivika.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Aho Yesu akamwamba, “Hauke ibiisi! Iyandikwa mwe Maandiko ya Muungu ‘Wendaumvikie Zumbe Muungu yako na kumgosoeya ndima yee ikedu!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Aho, ibiisi akambada, na wandima wa uwanga uko kwa Muungu wakamwezea na kumwambiiza.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avoka ndima si ya Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu ekusikiaho Yohana Mbatiiza kagewa mwe kifungo akaita mwe si ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Yesu khekwekaa Nazaleti iya kaita kwekaa Kapelinaumu mzi wekuwao hehi na tondoo da mazi da Galilaya mwe miyaka ya si ya Zabuloni na Nafutali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Iganie ida mbui ya uwoni wa muoni Isaya inga ikugombekavyo.<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Si ya Zabuloni na si ya Nafutali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Kwe sia ya kwembokea tondoo da mazi phande ya Yolodani na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya si ya wantu wesawokuwa Wayahudi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Wantu wada wekwekaao mwe kiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Wauona ung'ao mkuu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Naho wekwekaao mwe si ya kiza na kuogoha ufe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Ung'azi uwezea.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kuvokea kisingi icho, Yesu akavoka kubiikia akagombeka, “Hitukani na mbade mavigaviga yenu kwamana useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu uhehi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awetanga wahina wakwe wa bosi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Kisingi Yesu ekuwaho enda khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi da Galilaya neawaona wandugu waidi walowa samaki, Simoni etangwae Petulo na Andulea ekuwaye nduguye, newawa wakazitambika nyavu zao mwe mazimshindo kwaviya wowo newawa walowa. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Naho Yesu akawamba, “Nitongeani na miye nendaniwagosoe nywie mnietee wantu inga walowa waetavyo samaki kaya.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Aho wakazibada nyavu zao na wakamtongea.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Ekuitaho hemeso, akawaona wandugu watuhu waidi Yakobo na Yohana wana wa Zebedayo. Awo newawa mwe ngaawa hamwe na tati yao Zebedayo nee wakagosoa nyavu zao. Yesu akawetanga, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />ahoaho wakaibada ngaawa hamwe na tati yao, wakamtongea Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abiikia wantu na kuhonya watamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu nekawa akaita kia hantu mwe mzi wa Galilaya, uku akahinya mwe nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi na kuwaabiikia Mbui Yedi za Useuta wa Muungu na kuhonya kia mbai ya matamu yose wekuwayo nayo wantu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Mbui zakwe zikaambazwa phande zose za si yose ya Siliya. Wekutozwao na matamu mbaimbai na suuba na wenye mazaiko na wagwao mtwi na wekuhooawo, naye Yesu akawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Mazumwezumwe makuu ya wantu kulawa mzi wa Galilaya na mzi wa Dekapoli na Yelusalemu na Yudea na phande ya Zigizigi da mazi da Yolodani wose wakamtongea.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awahinya wantu mwe muima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu ekuyaonaho mazumwezumwe ya wantu akakwea kwe muima akekaa. Wahina wakwe nao wakambasa, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />nae akavoka kuwahinya.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kinyemi cha kwei</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Wendawawe na nyemi wada wantu wamanyao kuwa wamkunda Muungu mwe wekazi wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">Mana useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu ni wao.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Wendawawe na nyemi wada wekuwao na hovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">Mana awo wenda wahongezwe.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Wenda wawe na nyemi wada wahuhusi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">Mana wendawahokee si ambayo Muungu ekuwaikiayo kiaga endaawekhe.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Wenda wawe na nyemi wada wenye saa na khiu ya kugosoa akundavyo Muungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">Kwaviya wenda weguswe.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Wendawawe na nyemi wada wenye mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">Kwaviya wenda wafiiwe mbazi.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Wenda wawe na nyemi wada wenao moyo mtana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">Kwaviya awo wenda wamwone Muungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Wenda wawe na nyemi wada waetao uivanisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">Kwaviya awo wenda wetangwe wana wa Muungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Wendawawe na nyemi wada wasuumizwao kwaajii ya kugosoa viya akundavyo Muungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">Kwaviya Useuta wa uwanga uko kwa Muungu ni wao.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Mwenda muwe na nyemi nywinywi wantu wendaho wawabee na kuwasuumiza na kuwagombeka ya ufyaimi wa mbai yoyose kwa uhokho kwaajii ya miye. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Muwe na nyemi muno kwaviya funge yenu ni khuu uko uwanga kwa Muungu. Ivyo nee wekuwasuumizavyo waoni wa Muungu wekuwaaho kisingi khamzati kuwaaho.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nywie ni inga Munyu na Mng'ao</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Nywie ni munyu wa inusi. Akini munyu ukaza umwiiye wakwe khaidahika vituhu kuvuza umwiiye wakwe, iya kwasigwa chongoi na kujatwa ni wantu.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Nywie ni ung'azi wa inusi! Mzi wekuzengwao uwanga ya muima khaudaha kwefisa. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Naho wantu khawawasha taa na kuigubika na nyungu iya waiika uwanga ya kintu cha kuikia taa iyo, ili iwamuikie wantu wose weumo mwe nyumba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Viyaviya mng'ao wenu na uwamuike wantu, naho waone ntendwa zenu ntana, wamtogoe Tati yenu ekuwaye uwanga uko kwa Muungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miko ya Muungu ekumwekayo Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Msekumamakhanya sheza kuiyusa miagiiyo ya Musa na mahinyo ya waoni iya ncheza kuiganiza. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Kwaviya nawamba kwei, adi aho mbingu na inusi zendazemboke, khahana katu hata hantu ekuwaho hadodo he miagiiyo ya Musa yendayoiyuswe adi yose yaiganie. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Naho mntu yoyose mwendaabade kutongea miko na kuwahinya wantu ivyo, endaetangwe mdodo muno mwe Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu, iya mntu azigosoae na kuzihinya, uyo endaetangwe mkuu mwe Useuta wa Uwanga uko kwa Muungu <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Nawagombeka, mwakundigwa mugosoe yada Muungu ayakundayo kusima viya wekugosoavyo wahinyi wa miko ya Musa na Mafalisayo, ama khivyo khamnamwengie mwe Useuta wa uwanga uko kwa Muungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya kuwahaza wantu wasekuwa na maya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mtegeeza wantu waaho kae wekwembigwavyo, ‘Usekukoma! Na mntu yoyose endaeakome endaaamuiwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Akini miye nawamba, yoyose amkimae nduguye wa kigosi hambu wakivyee akundigwa aamuiwe. Na ambae ambea nduguye endaegalwe he mkonga. Amwetangae nduguye, ‘Mhezi’ akundigwa engie mwe tubwi diwakado moto wesaokukomeka. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Ukegaa malavyo yako uwanga ya ingo na ahoaho ukamanya khamwevana na nduguyo, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />bada malavyo yako hemeso ya ingo, na uite ukevane na nduguyo, nee uuye ulavye malavyo yako.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Evana na mmasa yako kinyio kisingi mke siai hamwe nae uku mwaita he mkonga, uyo mmasa yako asekweza akakubuza kwa muamua nae muamua akakwekhia kwa maasikai na kugewa mwe kifungo.” <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Kwa kwei nakwamba khunaulawe umo adi uihe hea ya kisikiizi.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awahaza kwa mbui ya ukianga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mtegeeza kuwa wantu nee wembigwa, ‘Usekugosoa ukianga.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Akini miye nawamba, endayeamkauwe mvyee kwa kumtamiiya endaawekagosoa nae ukianga mwe moyo wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ziso dako da kuume dikakutenda ugosoe mavigaviga diuse ukadase hae. Ni ebae kwaza kimamo kimwe cha mwii wako kusima mwii wako wose utambikwe mwe tubwi diwakado moto wesaokukomeka. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Na inga mkono wako wa kuume ukakutenda ugosoe mavigaviga usenge na uwase hae. Ni ebae hako kwaza kimamo kimwe cha mwii wako, kusima mwii wako wose utambikwe mwe tubwi diwakado moto wesaokukomeka.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya kuemeza kubadana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Naho igombekwa kuwa, ‘Mgosi yoyose ambadae mkaziwe, akundigwa amwekhe bauwa ya kubadana.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Akini miye nawamba mgosi yoyose khakundigwa kumbada mkaziwe kwa masa yoyose, iya kwa mbui ya ukianga du, akini ambadae mkaziwe kwa masa yoyose amtenda mkaziwe awe mkianga na mgosi yoyose endaeamtegue yuda mvyee mwekubadwa agosoa ukianga.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbui ya kuaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Naho mtegeeza wekwembigwavyo wantu wa kae kuwa, ‘Inga ukaika kiaga chako kwa Zumbe wakundigwa ukiiganize.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Iya miye nawamba mwesekuaha katu iwe uwanga kwa Muungu, kwaviya uwanga kwa Muungu ni kigoda cha Useuta wa Muungu, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />naho msekuahia inusi, kwaviya nee hantu hakwe Muungu hakuikia miundi, naho kwa Yelusalemu kwaviya ni mzi wa Seuta Mkuu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Naho usekuaha kwa mtwi wako kwaviya khudaha kugosoa hata fii mwenga iwe size hambu yekung'aayo. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ukagombeka, ‘Eehe, naiwe eehe’ Na ukagombeka, ‘Khio kwei naiwe khio.’ Chochose kitendesacho chalawa kwa yuda Ibiisi.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya kuemeza kuihiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mtegeeza nee igombekwa, ‘Ziso kwa ziso, zino kwa zino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Iya miye nawamba, usekuiha masa kwa mntu ekukugosoeaye mafyaimi. Mntu akakutoa kofi funda da kuume, mhituiye na dakumoso. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Mntu akundae kukwegaa mwe mkonga na kukunda kukudoeya shati dako mbadie adoe na koti dako. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Mntu akakushuutiza kwenua fuushi dakwe kilomita mwenga, wee wenue kilomita mbii. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Akuombezae mwekhe, akundae kukuazima kintu usekumuemeeya.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya ukundiso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mtegeeza kuwa nee igombekwa, ‘mkundise mmbuya wako na umkime mmasa yako.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Akini miye nawamba, wakundiseni wamasa wenu na kuwavika wada wawasuumizao nywie, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />ili mdahe kuwa wana wa tati yenu mwe uko uwanga kwa Muungu kwaviya yee aditenda zuwa diwekhe mng'ao wakwe kwa wantu wafyaimi na wantu wedi, na viyaviya fua yanya kwa wantu wamzumiiyao Muungu na wantu wesaokumzumiiya Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Mkawakundisa du wada wawakundisao ivi mwendamwekhigwe kintu yani? Kwaviya watozao ushuu nao wagosoa ivyoivyo! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Inga mkasagua kugosoa yedi kwa wambuya wenu du ivi muwatendesa watuhu kintu chani? Kwaviya ata wantu wesaokummanya Muungu nao wagosoa ivyoivyo! <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Naho mwesekuhungukiwa na kintu chochose inga Tati yenu wa uwanga kwa Muungu ambavyo khekuhungukiwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kuwaambiza wakiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Ekauweni mwesekugosoa inga wakundavyo wantu, ili wawatogoe. Kwaviya mkagosoa inga ivyo khamnampate funge kwa Tati yenu mwe uko uwanga kwa Muungu.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Ivyo muwaambizavyo wakiwa, mwesekweambaza kwa wantu, inga wabakha wagosoavyo mwe nyumba za kukintania Wayahudi na siai ili wantu wawatogoe. Kwei nawagombeka, awo wekhigwa kae funge. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Akini wee umuambizavyo mkiwa gosoa ivyo na mntu yoyose asekumanya. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Umuambiize mtu kwesiho mntu kumanya na Muungu Tate endaakwekhe funge.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya kuvika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Mvikaho msekugosoa inga wabakha, wowo wakunda kuvika wakawa wagooka mwe nyumba ya kukintania wayahudi na mwe sia phanda ili wantu wawakauwe. Kwei nawamba awo wekhigwa kae funge dao. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Akini wee uvikaho engia gati kwako vugaa uvi, naho umvike Tati yako esae kuoneka. Nae Tati yako aonae sii, endaakwekhe funge.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Naho mvikaho, mwesekutamwiiya ntamwiizi zesazo kuwa na mana inga wantu wesao kummanya Muungu, kwaviya wowo wamamakhanya wendawategeezwe kwa ntamwiizi zao kuwa nyingi. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Naho mwesekuigana nao kwaviya Tati yenu amanya muyakundayo kabla khamzati kumwombeza. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Naho ivi nemkundigwavyo kuvika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Tati yetu mwe uko uwanga kwa Muungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Zina dako ditogolwe muno.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Useuta wako weze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">Yada ukundayo yagosoke uko uwanga kwako Muungu na yagosoke mwe inusi<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Utekhe khande yetu kia msi.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Utiekee masa yetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">Inga swiswi tiwaekeavyo masa wamasa wetu.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Usekutigea mwe mageezo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Akini utihonye na ibiisi kwaviya Useuta niwako na udaho na ukuu hata misi zose zesazo na kisiikizi. Pepa.’<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Kwaviya mkawaekea wantu masa yao na Tati yenu wa uko uwanga kwa Muungu endaawaekee na nywinywi <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Naho mkesekuwaekea wantu masa yao na Tati yenu khanaawaekee nywinywi masa yenu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miagiiyo ya kwehiniza kuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Mwehinizaho kuda khande, mwesekugosoa inga wabakha, wehituao kuwa wenye hovu na kunyafuisa vyeni vyao, ili wantu wawaone kuwa wehiniza kuda khande. Kwei nawamba wapata kae funge zawo. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Akini mwehinizaho kuda, esiseni mavuta mwe mitwi yenu na kusunta vyeni vyenu, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />ili kwehiniza kwenu kuda kwesekumanyika na wantu watuhu, iya Tati yenu ekaae hantu hasii, nae Tati yenu aonae sii endaawekhe funge zenu.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiikizo cha uko uwanga kwa Muungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Mwesekweikia kiikizo hanu he inusi ambaho mswa na kutu, na wabavi wengia na kubawa. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Eikieni kiikizo uko uwanga kwa Muungu ambaho mswa na kutu khawadaha kubananga na wabavi khawadaha kuita kutua na kubawa. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Kwaviya hada cheiho kiikizo chako nee wendahouwe moyo wako.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mng'ao wa mwii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Ziso ni taa ya mwii. Inga ziso dako ni gima mwii wako wose wendauwe mwe mng'ao. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Akini ikawa ziso dako khio gima mwii wako wose wendauwe mwe kiza. Naho mng'ao wekuwao umo mwako ukawa kiza, umanye icho kiza ni chakutisa muno.<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumkundisa Muungu hambu kukundisa vintu vingi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Khahana mntu adahae kuwagosoeya ndima mazumbe waidi, kwaviya enda amgosoee ndima vitana zumbe yumwe na kumbea mtuhu. Khamdaha kumkundisa Muungu hamwe na vintu vingi.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Ivyo nawamba, msekuwa na matumatu uwanga ya khande na vidomeo hambu mii yenu mvae mbwai, kwaviya kwekaa kwenu khakukauwiiya khande du na mii yenu khaikauwiiya magwanda. <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Wakauweni wadege wa uwanga khawahanda na khawabonda na khawana khande mwe taa dodose. Hata ivyo Tati yenu wa uwanga awaisa. Tambe nywie khamna yombe kusima aho? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Nindai gatigati yenu mwenye maatu muno adaha kweongeza msi wa kwekaa kwakwe?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Kwambwai mwepisha kwaajii ya magwanda? Kauweni mauwa ya mzituni yatamavyo, khayagosoa ndima wala khayegosweeya magwanda yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Iya nawamba hata seuta Selemani mwenye na vintu vyakwe vyose khekuwahi kuvikwa vitana inga uwa dimweaho. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Naho ikawa Muungu ayavika ivi mani ya mwe minda ambayo ivyeo yaaho na kioi yasigwa mwe moto, Nywie wantu wenye uzumizi mdodo namba nywie enda awagosoee muno?<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Aho msekuwa na matumatu, ‘Tendatideni? Tendatidomee mbwai? Tendativae mbwai?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Kwaviya ayo yose yaondezwa na wantu wesaokummanya Muungu. Tate yenu wa uwanga amanya ati mwakunda vintu ivyo vyose. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Naho vokani kuuondeza Useuta wakwe, na kugosoa viya akundavyo Muungu na ayo yose mwendamwekhigwe na ngeeko. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Naho msekuwa na matumatu ya kioi, kwaviya kioi ina yakwe. Kiya msi ina suuba yakwe.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Mahazo ya kuemeza kuwaamuia watuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luka 6:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Msekuwaamuiiya watuhu, msekweza na nywie mkaamuiiwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Kwaviya mwendavyomuwaamuiiye watuhu nee ivyo na nywie mwendavyomuamuiiwe, na kihimo kiakia muhimiacho watuhu nee icho mwendachomuhimiwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Kwambwai waona kibasi mwe ziso da nduguyo na ahoaho khuona basi mwe ziso dako? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Hambu wadaha viivihi kumwamba nduguyo ‘Mwaya eka nikuuse iki kibasi mwe ziso dako kisingi wee mwenye una basi mwe ziso dako?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Mbakha wee usa basi deumo mwe ziso dako naho ndiho wendahoudahe vitana kuusa kibasi mwe ziso da nduguyo.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Msekuwekha makui vintu vya vyekuikwavyo kwajii ya Muungu wasekweza wakahituka na kuwakwacha naho msekuwawasia nguuwe lulu zenu wasekweza kuzijata.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ombeza na ondeza na kon'ta uvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Ombezani nanywi mwendamwekhigwe, na ondezani nanywi mwendampate na ukon'te uvi na mwenda mvuguiwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Kwaviya mntu yoyose aombezae ekhigwa na aondezae apata na akon'tae uvi avugwiiwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Tambe kuna yumweaho mwanawe akamwombeza bumunda enda amwekhe iwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Hambu akamwombeza samaki endaamwekhe nyoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ikawa ninywi wenye mavigaviga mwamanya kuwekha wana wenu vintu vitana, haika Tati yenu mwe uwanga kwa Muungu endaawekhe vintu vitana muno kwa wada wamuombezao.<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Yoyose mkundayo wantu wawagosoee na nywie muwagosoee inga ivyo. Kwaviya inu nemiagiiyo ya Musa na mahinyo ya waoni wa Muungu.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sia sisii na sia phana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Engiani kwa kwembokea uvi msisii, kwaviya sia iitayo umo mwe ubanasi ni phana, na sia ya kwengiiya umo ni phana, na wembokeao sia iyo ni wangi. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Iya sia iitayo mwe ugima ni sisii na uvi wa kwengiiya ni msisii, ni wantu wachechedu wadahao kuiyona sia iyo.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mti wamanyika kwa matunda yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Muwe hae nao waoni wa uhokho wowo weza kwenu wakaoneka inga ngoto kwa chongoi akini kwa ndani ni inga makui makai ya mzituni. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Mwendamuwamanye kwa wayagosoayo inga timanyavyo mti kulawana na matunda yakwe. Ivi tambe wantu watunda zabibu mwe migunga hambu matunda yetangwayo tini mwe mbigii? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Iya mti mtana wavyaa matunda matana na mti mfyaimu wavyaa matunda mafyaimu. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mti mtana khaudaha kuvyaa matunda mafyaimi na mti mfyaimi khaudaha kuvyaa matunda matana. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Kia mti wesao kuvyaa matunda matana wenda usengwe na kwasigwa mwe moto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Ivyo mwendamuwamanye kwa yada wayagosoayo.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khiwamanya nywie</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Khio kia mntu anetangae ‘Zumbe, Zumbe,’ enda engie mwe Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu iya ni yudadu mgosoa yada ya Tate yangu wa uwanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Wantu wangi wendawanambe misi ida, ‘Zumbe, Zumbe! Kwa zina dako tibiikia mbui zako na kwa zina dako tiwaavya mazaiko na kugosoa vihii vingi.’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Aho nendanimwambe ‘Nchekuwamanya nywie katu haukeni aha hangu nywie mgosoao mavigaviga.’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazengi waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Ivyo kia mntu ategeezae mbui zangu na kuzigosoa aigana na mntu mwenye akii, mwekuzenga nyumba yakwe uwanga ya iwe kuu. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Fua ikanya, mazigizigi ya mazi yakamema na khusi khai ikeza ikatoa iyo nyumba. Akini khayokugwa kwaviya izengwa uwanga ya iwe kuu.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Na yoyose ategeezae mbui zangu izi na akesekuzitozeeza, aigana na mntu mhezi mwekuzenga nyumba yakwe uwanga ya sanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Fua ikanya, mazigizigi ya mazi yakamema, khusi khai ikeza na kuitoa iyo nyumba nayo ikagwa, naho kugwa uko kuwa kukuu muno.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udaho wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu ekubindaho kugombeka mbui iyo zumwezumwe da wantu wakahondomazwa na mahinyo yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Kwaviya nee kawa akahinya khio inga wahinyi wa maagiiyo iya kahinya inga mwenye udaho.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu mwenye nyoka khuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu ekuseeaho kwe muima na zumwezumwe da wantu dikambasa. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Nee eza mntu yumwe mwenye utamu wa nyoka khuu na akamkintia mavindi na kugombeka, “Zumbe ukakunda wadaha kuning'aza!”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu akaunyoosha mkono akamdonta na kugombeka, “Nakunda, ng'azika!.” Ahoaho mntu uyo akahona utamu wakwe wa nyoka khuu. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Naho Yesu akamwamba, “Kauwa, usekumwamba mntu yoyose, iya hita ukeonyeshe kwa mviki na kulavya malavyo inga akwambavyo Musa, na wantu wamanye kuwa kuhona.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzumiia kwa mkuu wa asikai wa Kilumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yesu ekuwaho engia mwe mzi wa Kapelinaumu, asikai mkuu yumwe akambasa na kumhembeeza, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />na kumwamba, “Zumbe, mndima yangu kagona kaya ni mtamu wa kuhooa na ahuma muno.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu akamwamba, “Hita nendaneze kumhonya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Uyo mkuu wa asikai akamwamba, “Zumbe, miye khifaa weye wengie kaya hangu. Akini wee gombeka mbui du na mndima yangu endaahone. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kwaviya hata miye ni mntu mkuu mwenye udaho mkuu, nenao asikai asi yangu. Nikamwamba yumwe, ‘Hita!’ Nae aita na mtuhu ‘Soo’ Nae eza, naho nikamwamba mndima wangu, ‘Gosoa kintu iki!’ Nae agosoa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu ekusikiaho ayo akahondomaa, akawagombeka wada wantu wekuwao wambasa, “Kwei nawamba khizati kumwona mntu mwe si ya Isilaeli mwenye uzumizi inga unu. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Iya nawamba kwei wantu wangi wendaweze kulawa awio da zua na engiiyo da zua naho wendawekae he ntafuno hamwe na Ibulahimu, na Isaka na Yakobo mwe Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Iya wada Waisilaeli wose wekukundigwao kuwa mwe Useuta uwo wendawasigwe chongoi mwe kiza, na uko wendawaiye na kuuma meno kwa usungu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Aho Yesu akamwamba uyo asikai wa Kilumi, hita kaya na iwe inga wekuzumiiavyo. Na mndima yakwe akahona saa idaida.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya wantu wangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu ekubuaho kaya kwa Petulo akamwona mkwewe da Petulo kagona mwe usazi, ana bomubomu kai. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Nee Yesu amdonta uyo mmaa mkono nee ahona, akenuka na kuvoka kumgosoeya ndima.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Yekubuaho guoni, wakamweeteya wantu wangi wekukwewao ni mazaiko, nae akayalavya ayo mazaiko kwa kugombeka mbui yakwe du, na wantu wose wekuwao watamu akawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Kagosoa ivyo ili yada ekugombekayo muoni Isaya yaiganie, “Yee mwenye kadoa unyonge wetu na akayenua matamu yetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakundigwao kuwa wahina wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu ekuonaho zumwezumwe da wantu dimuikia bunga akawamba wahina wakwe waite phande ya kaidi ya tondoo da mazi. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Mhinyi yumwe wa miko akambasa na kumwamba, “Mhinyi miye nenda nikutongee hohose wendako uite.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Ukwii wana maphanga, wadege wana masasa, iya Mwana wa Mntu khana hantu hakuhumwiiza.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Yumwe wa wahina wakwe akamwamba, “Zumbe unekhe uhusa niite nikamzike tate.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Akini Yesu akamtambaisa, “Nitongee! Wabade wekuuyao na nyuma wawazike wekuuyao na nyuma wao.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atwiiza khusi khai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Naho Yesu akakwea ngaawa hamwe na wahina wakwe wakahauka wose. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Na wekuwaho mwe tambo vuupuu mwe mazimshindo ikalawiiya khusi khai hata mkubwadiso wa mazi ukavoka kugubika ngaawa, iya Yesu nee kagona usisiza. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Wahina wakambasa, wakamwenua wakagombeka, “Zumbe, tiohoe tadagamia!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Kwambwai mwaogoha, nywie wantu wenye uzumizi mdodo?” Ahoaho akenuka akaiwakia ida khusi na mkubwaniso wa mazi twiyani, nee kwatwiiya tui.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Wada wantu wakahondomaa na kugombeka, “Uyu ni mntu yevivihi? Hata khusi na mkubwadiso vyamtegeeza!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya wantu waidi wenye mazaiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu ekubuaho phande ya kaidi wa si ya Wagelasi na uko nekuwa na wagosi waidi wekuwao na mazaiko wakakintana nae, wowo nee walawiiya mwe mbiya. Awa nee ni wantu watisao muno na wenye nguvu, naho khahana mntu mwekudaha kwembokea sia iyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Wekukintanaho na Yesu nee wavoka kutoa vuzo, “Wakunda mbwai kwetu, wee Mwana wa Muungu? Kweza kutisuumiza kisingi kikundigwacho khakizati kubua?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Hehi na hantu aho nee hawa na tintimo da nguuwe wakaiswa. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Nee ayo mazaiko yakamhembeeza Yesu, “Inga ukatilavya utibade tiwengie wada nguuwe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu akawamba, “Hitani.” Aho wakalawa mwe wantu awo na kuwengiiya wada nguuwe, nee tintimo da nguuwe. Dikaseeya mwe mpoomoko mkai wakengia mwe tondoo da mazi, nguuwe wose wakauya na nyuma mwe mazi.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Wada waisi wa awo nguuwe wakaguuka wakaita mwe mzi uko na kuwamba wantu mbui zose zekulawiiazo kwa wada wantu wekuwao wakwewa ni mazaiko. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Nee wantu wose mwe mzi uda wakalawa mwe mzi na kumbasa Yesu na wekumuonaho wakamwombeza ahauke mwe si yao.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu mwenye kuohowa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu akakwea ngaawa, akadumua ntondoo da mazi na kubua mwe mzi wa Kapelinaumu ekuwaho akekaa. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Aho wakamwetea mntu mwenye kuhooa mwii, kagonezwa mwe javi. Yesu ekuonaho uzumizi wao, akamwamba uyo mntu mwe kuhooa, “Ekhe moyo mwanangu! Kuekewa mavigaviga yako.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Naho wamwe wa wahinyi wa miko wakavoka kumamakhanya mwe mioyo yao, “Mntu uyu amdumua Muungu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu akayamanya wamamakhanyayo, akamba “Kwambwai mwamamakhanya ufyaimi mwe mioyo yenu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ni dihi dekuhuhado muno, kugombeka, ‘kuekewa mavigaviga, hambu kugombeka, gooka wende?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Naho, nakunda mmanye Mwana wa Mntu ana udaho mwe inusi ya kuwaekea wantu mavigaviga.” Aho akamwamba uyo mntu mwekuhoowa, “Enuka, udoe javi dako uite kaya kwako.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Yuda mntu ekuhooae akahauka na kuita kaya kwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Zumwezumwe da wantu dekuwado hada, dikahondomaa na kuogoha, wakamtogoa Muungu ekuwekhae wantu udaho wa namna iyo.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwetanga Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu akahauka hantu hada, na ekuwaho akaita zakwe, akamwoona mntu yumwe etangwae Matayo, kekaa mwe kazumba cha kuihiiya ushuu. Nee, Yesu amwamba, “Nibase.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Matayo akenuka, akambasa.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu ekuwaho kaya kwa Matayo kekaa ada khande, watoza ushuu wangi na wenye mavigaviga wakeza na kwekaa hamwe na Yesu na wahina wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Mafalisayo wekuonaho, wakawamba wahina wakwe, “Kwambwai mhinyi yenu ada khande hamwe na watoza ushuu na wenye mavigaviga?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu ekuwategeezaho, akawatambaisa, “Wantu wenye ugima khawakunda mganga, iya watamu du nee wakundao mganga. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Akini hitani, mkehinye mana ya mbui inu. ‘Nakunda mbazi khio ntambiko.’ Nchekweza kuwetanga wantu wedi iya wenye mavigaviga.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auzwa kuusu bui ya kwehiniza kuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Naho wahina wa Yohana Mbatiiza wakamtimia Yesu, na kumuuza, “Swie na Mafalisayo tehiniza kuda, kwambwai wahina wako khawehiniza kuda?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Ivi wekugonekwao kwe ndoza wadaha viivihi kutoa bwaimbo kisingi zumbe wa ndoza yuke hamwe nao? Havidaika! Iya kisingi chendakibue ambaho zumbe wa wiya endaho ausigwe gatigati yao, kisingi icho ndiho wendaho wehinize kuda.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Wantu khawagea kilaka cha gwanda dihya mwe gwanda dekusakaayo. Kwa mana kilaka icho chendakitatue diya gwanda dekusakaayo, na hada hekutatukaho endahagenyee.<figure style="fig" file="11 Unshrunk Patch.jpg" size="col" ref="9:16">Kilaka kitatuka kwaviya nekiikwa mwegwanda da kae</figure> <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Naho wantu khawageya divai mphya mwe mikwiji yekusakaayo, inga akatenda ivyo iyo divai mphya yendaitatue iyo mikwiji na divai yendayetike na mikwiji iyo yendaibanike. Divai mphya yagewa mwe mikwiji ya babu mihya.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana kindee wa Mkuu yumwe na mmaa yumwe wahonywa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yesu ekuwaho akagombeka ayo, mkuu yumwe wa Wakiyahudi neabuwa, akamkintia mavindi na kugombeka, “Mwanangu ya kindee kauya kae na nyuma isasa ivi. Akini tite ukamwikie mkono, nae endaatende mgima.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu akahauka akatongeana nae, nao wahina wakwe wakamtongea. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Kisingi ichoicho, mmaa yumwe, mwekuwa na utamu wa mtuo kwa kisingi cha myaka kumi dimwe na mbii, nee amtongea Yesu kwa nyuma, akadonta msao wa gwanda dakwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Kwaviya nee kegombekea mwe moyo wakwe, “Nikadonta du gwanda dakwe, nendanihone.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu nee ahituka akamwona, akamwamba, “Ekhe moyo biti yangu! Uzumizi wako ukuohoa.” Mmaa uyo akahona saa idaida.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Naho Yesu akengia nyumbani kwa yuda mkuu. Na ekuwaonaho wantu wavuzia fiimbi na zumwezumwe kuu da wantu wakatoa bwaimbo, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />akagombeka, “Haukeni aha! Mndee uyu khekuuya na nyuma, kagonadu.” Nawo nee wamseka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Naho, zumwezumwe da wantu dekuuswaho, Yesu akengia mda ndani, akamtoza mkono uyo mndee, nae akenuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Mbui iyo ikaambazika mwe si ida yose.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awahonya matuntu waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu ekuwaho ahauka hantu aho, matuntu waidi wakambasa na kutoa vuzo, “Mwana wa Daudi, utifiiye mbazi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu ekwengiaho nyumbani, wantu awo waidi wakamtimia, nae akawauza, “Ivi, mwazumiiya nadaha kutenda mbui iyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Nao nee wamtambaisa, “Eehe, Zumbe.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Aho Yesu akayadonta meso yao, akawamba, “Naiwe inga mzumiiavyo!” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Meso yao yakagubulwa. Nee Yesu akawahaza muno, “Mwesekumwamba mntu yoyose mbui inu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Iya wowo wakalawa na kuambaza mbui zakwe Yesu mwe si ida yose.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya bubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Wantu wada waidi wekuwaho wakahauka, watuhu wakamwetea Yesu mntu yumwe mwekuwa mbubu naho kakwewa ni zaiko. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Ahoaho uyo zaiko dekulavigwaho, mntu uyo mwekuwa mbubu akavoka kutamwiiya vituhu. Wantu wakahondomaa na kugombeka, “Mbui inga inu khaizati kulawiiya kwa wantu wa Isilaeli!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Iya Mafalisayo wakagombeka, “Ayaguusa mazaiko kwa udaho wa mkuu wa mazaiko.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awafiiya mbazi wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu akavuiiya mizi yose mikuu na phaamo zose, akahinya he nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi na kubiikia Mbui Yedi za Useuta wa Muungu, na kuwahonya wantu matamu yose. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Na ekuwaonaho wantu, zumwezumwe kwa zumwezumwe, akawafiiya mbazi kwaajii newasokea muno na wenye maatumaatu inga ngoto wesao kuwa na muisi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Ivyo akawamba wahina wakwe, “Ubosi ni mwingi, iya wagosozi wandima niwacheche. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Ivyo mwombezeni mwenye uwo ubosi aagiiye wagosozi wa ndima wabonde ubosi wakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awagiiya wahina wakwe kumi dimwe na mbii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Naho Yesu akawetanga wahina wakwe kumi dimwe na waidi na kuwekha udaho wakulavya mazaiko na kuhonya matamu yose. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Mazina ya awo waagiiwa kumi dimwe na mbii, Wabosi ni Simoni etangwae Petulo na Andulea nduguye na Yakobo mwana wa Zebedayo na Yohana nduguye, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo na Batolomayo, na Tomaso na Matayo mwekuwa mtoza ushuu na Yakobo mwana wa Alifayo na Tadei, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni ambae nekawa mtoanaji kwaajii ya si yakwe hambu zelote na Yuda Isikaliote mwekumhituka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekuwaagiiacho kuita kugosoa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu akawaagiiya awo waagiiwa kumi dimwe na mbii na kuwekha miagiiyo inu, “Mwesekuita kwa wantu wesaokuwa Wayahudi, naho mwesekwengiya mwe mizi ya Wasamalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Iya hitani kwa wantu wa Isilaeli wekwagao inga ngoto. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Na mwiitaho biikiani ivi, ‘Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu uhehi!’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Wahonyeni watamu na wekuyao na nyuma wayuyuseni, na wasunteni wenye utamu wa nyoka na lavyeni mazaiko. Mwekhigwa bue na nywie lavyeni bue. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Mwesekudoa mwe mikwiji yenu zahabu, wala hea wala sensi za shaba. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Mwesekudoa mfuko wa ntambo wa kuombezea vintu siai, wala shati da hakiba nawala sabana wala ngoda. Kwaviya mgosozi wa ndima akundigwa ekhigwe maiho yakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Mkengia mwe mzi wowose mkuu hambu phaamo yoyose, ondezani mntu ambae akunda kuwahokea na ekaeni aho hake adi mwendaho mhauke hantu aho. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Mwengiaho mwe nyumba iyo ugusani wenyezi wakwe, na kuwamba, ‘Uivanisi uwe nanywi.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Inga waaho wantu wedi mwe kaya iyo mkawaombee Muungu awajaiye uivanisi, ati khawana wawe awo wantu wedi Muungu khanaawajaiye. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Inga mntu yoyose akaemea kuwahokea hambu kuwategeeza, naho mlawaho mwe nyumba iyo hambu mzi uwo kung'untani sanga ya mwe miundi yenu inga hazo kwao. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Kwei nawagombeka, msi wakuamuiwa mzi uwo wendawekhigwe sugusa khuu kusima ida yekwekhigwayo ya mizi ya Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masumiizo yezayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maliko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Isasa miye nawaagiiya inga ngoto gatigati ya makui ya mzituni. Muwe na unyanyi inga nyoka na muwe wahuhusi inga sua. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Ekaeni hae na wantu, kwaviya wendawamigwiye na kuwegaa mwe mikonga, na wenda wamitoe ngoda mwe nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Mwendamwegalwe hemeso ya wagookezi na Maseuta kwaajii yangu, ili mdahe kuwagombeka wowo mbui zangu na kwa wantu wesaokuwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Naho wendahowawegae he mikonga msekuogoha mwendavyo mgombeke, kwaviya saa idaida mwenda mwekhigwe yakugombeka. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kwaviya khio nywie mwendaomgombeke, iya ni Muye wa Muungu wa Tati yenu nee endaeagombeke umo mwenu.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Ndugu endamhituke nduguye akomwe, na tate endaamhituke mwanawe, wana nao wenda wawahituke wavywazi wao wakomwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Wantu wose khawana wawakundise kwaajii yangu. Akini mwenda azizimize adi kisiikizi nee mwendaaoholwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Wantu wakasumiiza mwe mzi unu guukani mzi mtuhu. Nawamba kwei, khamna mbindiize mizi yose ya wantu wa si ya Isilaeli hadi Mwana wa Mntu endaho eze.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Mhina khadaha kumwemboka mhinyi yakwe, na mndima nae khadaha kumwemboka zumbe yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Yadahika mhina kuwa inga mhinyi yakwe na yadahika mndima kuwa inga zumbe yakwe. Ikawa wanetanga miye mkuu yenu Belizebuli, Ivi nywie khawana wawetange mazina mafyaimi muno.<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akundigwae kuogolwa ni Muungu na khio mntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Naho msekuwaogoha wantu awo, kwaviya kia mbui yekugubikwayo yendaigubulwe, na kia chekufiswacho chendakioneke. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Niwagombekayo nywie mwekiza myagombeke hewazo. Kiya niwanong'onezacho nawakunda mkitamwiiye kwa mgutio kiya mntu ategeeze. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Msekuwaogoha wada waukomao mwii, akini khawadaha kuukoma muye. Mwakundigwa kumwogoha Muungu adahae kudagamiza mwii hamwe na muye mwe tubwi diwakado moto wesaokukomeka. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Wadege waidi wadodo watagwa kwa senti mwenga ndodo. Akini ata yumwe aho kagwa asi kwesiho Tate yenu kumanya. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Hata ntaazia ya fii za mitwi yenu Muungu azimanya. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Kwa iyo msekuogoha nywie ni watana hemeso ya Muungu kusima wadege wangi.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumzumiia na kumuemea Klistu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Na yoyose mwendaye anizumiiye hemeso ya wantu, miye nami nendanimzumiiye hemeso ya Tate yangu wa uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Iya yoyose mwendayeaniemee hemeso ya wantu, na miye nenda nimuemee hemeso ya Tate yangu wa uwanga kwa Muungu.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nchekueta uivanisi iya khondo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Msekumamakhanya kuwa ncheza kueta uivanisi mwe inusi iya ncheza kueta khondo. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kwaviya ncheza kueta kutokwevana kwa mntu na tati yakwe biti na mami yakwe, mkaza mwana na mame vyaa khawana wevane. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Na mmasa wa mntu ni wantu wakaya kwakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Amkundisae tate hambu mami yakwe kusima anikundisavyo miye, khadaha kuwa hamwe na miye na akundisae wanawe kusima miye, khadaha kuwa mhina wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Mntu mwesaekuudoa mhamba wakwe na kunitongea khadaha kuwa mhina wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Mntu akundae kuuhonya ugima wakwe endaawaze, akini endaeawaze ugima wakwe kwaajii yangu wenda wekhigwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wendao wahokee funge</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maliko 9:41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Na yoyose awahokea nywie anihokea miye. Na yoyose anihokea miye, amhokea yuda mwekuniagiiya. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Na yoyose amhokeaye Muoni kwaajii ni Muoni, endaahokee funge da Muoni. Na yoyose amhokeaye mntu agosoaye yada akundayo Muungu, endaekhigwe funge idaida ambayo wekhingwa wada ambao wagosoa akundayo Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Nawagombeka kwei, yoyose mwendaamwekhe yumwe aho wa wadodo awa kikombe cha mazi ya pheho kwaajii ni mhina yangu, haika khana akose katu kwekhigwa funge dakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Wahina kulawa kwa Yohana Mbatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu ekubindaho kuwekha miagiiyo wahina wakwe, akalawa aho, akaita kuhinya na kubiikia mwe mizi yao uko Galilaya.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yohana ekuwaho mwe kifungo nee asikia mbui za Klistu, akawaagiiya wahina wakwe, waite kumuuza, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />weye nee yuda ezae, hambu timkauwiye mtuhu?<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Hitani mkamgombekee Yohana mbui mtegeezazo na kuziona, <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />matuntu waona, wesaokudaha kwenda wenda, na viziba wategeeza, na wenye utamu wa nyoka wasuntika na wekuuyao na nyuma wayuyuswa, na wakiwa wabiikiwa Mbui Yedi. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Endaawe na nyemi mntu yuda ambae khana maatu na miye.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Wada wahina wa Yohana wekuwaho wakahauka, Yesu akavoka kugombeka na dia zumwezumwe kuusu Yohana, Mbatiiza. Akawauza, “Mwekuitaho kuda he nyika, mwita kukauwa mbwai? Ivi nee mkakunda kuona inde dikasingiswa ni khusi? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Inga khivyo, mwiita kukauwa mbwai? Mwiita kukauwa mntu mwekwehasika magwanda matana? Wantu wehasikao magwanda inga ayo, wekaa mwe nyumba ya Maseuta. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Naho, mwita kukauwa mbwai? Muoni wa Muungu? Haika nawamba, nee mwiita kumuona mntu ekuwaye mkuu kusima muoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Uyo nee ambae mbui zakwe ziandikwa mwe Maandiko ya Muungu, ‘Kauwa namuagiiya mwagiiwa yangu aniongweee, mwendayeagosoe sia he meso yako.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Nagombeka kwei mwa wantu wekuvyaigwao na wavyee, khazati kulawiiya mntu mkuu inga Yohana Mbatiiza, akini ambae ni mdodo muno mwe useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu, ni mkuu kusima Yohana <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kuvokea kisingi cha Yohana Mbatiiza adi isasa Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu wapatikana kwa nguvu, naho wantu wenye udaho wageeza kuudoa. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Kwaviya miagiiyo ya Musa na mahinyo yose ya waoni adi kisingi cha Yohana zatamwiiya mbui za useuta wa Muungu wendavyouwe kwa kisingi iki. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ikawa mwakunda kuzumia ido, yee Yohana nee uyo Eliya ambae waoni newawa wakagombeka endaeze. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Yee mwenye magutwi na ategeeze!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Akini nikiiganiye na mbwai kivyazi iki? Kiigana na wana wekaao gwiiyo, wawetangao wezwao na kuwagombeka, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Nee tiwatoea ngoma na wala khamwekuvina, na titoa wiya za bwaimbo na wala khamwekuiya.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kwaviya Yohana Mbatiiza keza akehiniza kuda na wala kuidomea divai, nao wakamwamba, ‘Kakwewa na mazaiko.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana wa Mntu keza, ada khande na kudomea, nao wakamwamba. ‘Mkauweni uyu ni mmeo, na ni mkozi, wambuya wakwe ni watoza ushuu na wenye mavigaviga!’ Ata ivyo unyanyi wa Muungu imanyika kuwa niyedi kulawana na ndima yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mizi ya wantu wesao kuzumiiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Ndiho Yesu akavoka kuihaza mizi ida ambayo kaigosweeya vihii vingi kusima kutuhu, kwaviya wantu wakwe khawakubada mavigaviga. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />Wendawakione wantu wa Kolozini! Wendawakione wantu wa Betisaida! Inga vihii vyekugosokavyo aha henu ati nee vigosoka kuda Tilo na Sidoni, wantu wakwe newavaa kae magwanda ya gunia na kwesisa mazeu na kuonyesha wabada mavigaviga. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Nagombeka kwei yendaiwe ihuha kwa wantu wa mizi ya Tilo na Sidoni kuzizimiza mwe msi wa kuamuiwa wa Muungu kusima aha henu. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Na nywie wantu wa Kapelinaumu, ivi wenda wenulwe adi uwanga kwa Muungu? Eehe, wenda useezwe adi si ya wekuyao nyuma, kwaviya inga vihii vyekugosokavyo aho hako inga nevigosoka mwe Sodoma mzi uwo neukeaho adi ivyeo. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Akini nagombeka kwei, msi wakuamwiiwa weye wenda wekhigwe sugusa khuu kusima ya Sodoma.<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sooni hangu mhumuize</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Kisingi icho Yesu akagombeka, “Nakutogoa ee Tate, Zumbe wa uwanga na wa inusi, kwaviya kuwafisa wenye unyanyi na umanyi, na ukawagubwiiya wana wadodo. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Eehe, Tate nee vyekukutamiavyo.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Tate yangu kanekha vintu vyose. Khahana ammanyae Mwana iya Tate, nawala ammanyae Tate iya Mwana, na yoyose yuda ambae Mwana akunda kumgubwiiya uyo endaammanye Tate.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Sooni aha hangu nywie nyose muangadikao na kuzamiwa na mafuushi, na miye nendaniwahumwiize. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Mzumiye kuongoewa na miye inga viya njeku afungwaho nila kisingi cha kuima, mkehine kulawa kwangu, kwaviya miye niyedi naho ni mnyenyekevu wa moyo, na nywie mwenda mwekhigwe nyemi. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kwaviya yendaiwe vihufu kwenu kwamana mahinyo yangu ni mahufu.” <figure style="fig" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" ref="11:30">Ng'ombe waidi wekuvaao nila ili kuima mnda</figure><verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe wa msi wa kuhumwiiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Kisingi icho Yesu akembokea kwe minda ya uhemba msi wa kuhumwiiza. Aho wahina wakwe wakawa nasaa, kusenga uhemba, wakada khokhoo zakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Mafalisayo wekuonaho ayo, wakamwamba Yesu, “Kauwa, wahina wako wagosoa mbui yesayokukundigwa kugosoka mwe Msi wa Kuhumwiiza.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Khamzati kusoma ekugosoavyo Daudi hamwe na weziwe kisingi wekuwaho na saa? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Yee kengia mwe nyumba ya Muungu akada yada mabumunda yekuikwayo hemeso ya Muungu. Khio yee wala wada weziwe khawekukundigwa kuda yada mabumunda iya nee yakundigwa kuigwa na waviki wowodu ikedu. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Tambe khamzati kusoma mwe miko, Waviki wakuu newawa wakabananga miko ya Msi wa Kuhumwiiza nao khawamamakhanywa kuwa wana masa? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Iya nawagombeka kwei, aha yuaho mkuu kusima nyumba ya Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Inga nee mmanya mana ya mbui inu, ‘Nakunda mbazi nawala khio ntambiko.’ Khamwekuwa mkawaamuiiya wantu wesaokukoa masa, <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />kwaviya Mwana wa Mntu nee Zumbe wa Msi wa kuhumwiiza.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mntu mwekuhoowa mkono</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu akahauka hantu aho, na kwengia mwe nyumba yao yakukintania Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Nekuwa na mntu yumwe mwenye mkono wekuhoao. Naho, wantu wakamuuza Yesu, “Kulawana na miko yetu, ivi ni vitana kuohoa mntu Msi wa Kuhumwiiza? Wamuuza ivyo wapate kumuamuiiya masa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu akawamba, “Ni ndai gatigati yenu mwenye ngoto yumwe, na yuda ngoto akengia mwe tubwi Msi wa Kuhumwiiza, ivi khanaamtoze na kumlavya? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Nakunda mmanye du, mntu ana yombe muno kusima ngoto! Aho ni vitana kugosoa matana Msi wa Kuhumwiiza.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Naho akamwamba yuda mntu, “Unyooshe uwo mkono.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Akanyoosha, nao ukawa mgima inga uda mtuhu. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Aho, Mafalisayo wakalawa chongoi na kufanyanya wendavyowadahe kumkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndima mwekusagulwa ni Muungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Akini Yesu ekumanyaho mamakhanyi zao, hantu hada akahalawa. Wantu wangi wakamtongea, akawahonya watamu wose. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Akawaemeza wasekumwamba mntu mbui zakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Ili yada ekwambayo Muoni Isaya yaiganie,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Kauwa mndima yangu nekumsaguae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Mkundiswa wangu nitamiwae nae mwe moyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Nenda niike Muye wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Nae enda aiyambaze miamuiyo kwa si zose.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Khana aete uhigano na wantu wala kutoa vuzo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">Wala mgutio wakwe khauna utegeezeke siai.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Lasi dekuhondekado khanaadibonde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">Wala utambi wa koloboi ufufutikao mosi khanaaukome</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Adi endaho atende uwamuiyo wa kwei ugooke wenye,<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Na wantu wose wendawamkauwiiye.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maliko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Aho wantu wakamwetea Yesu mntu mwekuwae ni tuntu naho khadaha kutamwiiya uku kakwewa ni mazaiko. Yesu nee amhonya ata akadaha kutamwiiya na kuona. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Zumwezumwe dose da wantu dikahondomaa na kugombeka, “Ivi yadahika ikawa nee Mwana wa Daudi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Akini Mafalisayo wekusikiaho ayo, newamba, “Mntu uyu ayaguusa mazaiko kwa udaho wa Belizebuli mkuu wa mazaiko.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu, akawamanya mamakhanyo zao, akawamba, “Useuta wowose wekupanganikao vizumwezumwe vihiganavyo khaudaha kwekaisa, naho mzi wowose hambu kaya yoyose yekupanganikayo vizumwezumwe vihiganavyo khavina vigooke. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Ikawa Ibiisi amguusa Ibiisi mweziwe ahigana mwenye. Aho useuta wakwe wenda ugooke viivihi? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Nywie mwamba ati naguusa mazaiko kwa udaho wa Belizebuli mkuu wa mazaiko. Awo wana wenu wayaguusa kwa udaho wa ndai? Kwaajii iyo wao nee wendao awaamuiye nywinywi. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Akini ikawa nayaguusa mazaiko kwa udaho wa Muye wa Muungu, aho mmanye Useuta wa Muungu ubua kae henu.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Yadahika viivihi mntu kwengia mwe nyumba ya mntu mwenye nguvu na kumhoka vintu vyakwe, kwesaho kuvoka kumzengeteza sigi uyo mntu mwenye nguvu? Akimzengeteza kae aho ndiho endahoadahe kumhoka mai zakwe.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Mntu yoyose mwese kuwa hamwe na miye ahigana na miye naho mtu yoyose mwesaekuika wantu hamwe na miye na kuwegaa kwa Muungu mtu uyo amwaganisa. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Kwaajii iyo nawamba, wantu wenda waekewe mavigaviga yao hamwe na kufuu zao, akini khawana waekewe mavigaviga ya kumbea Muye wa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Nae agombekae mbui ya kuhigana na Mwana wa Mntu enda aekewe, akini yuda agombekae mbui ya kuhigana na Muye wa Muungu khana aekewe mwe si inu wala ida yezayo.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mti na matunda yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Ukauweni mti uwe mtana na matunda yakwe yenda yawe matana na ugosoeni mti kuwa mfyaimi na matunda yakwe yenda yawe mafyaimi, kwaviya mti wamanyika kwa matunda yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Nywie uvyazi wa mdudu mwadaha viivihi kugombeka mbui ntana kisingi nywinywi wenye ni wenye mavigaviga? Kwaviya mntu agombeka yada yekumemayo mwe moyo wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mntu yedi ulavya mbui zedi mwe moyo wakwe na mntu mfyaimi hulavya mbui zakwe za ufyaimi kwe moyo wakwe wa ufyaimi.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Iya nawamba, mwe msi wakuamuiwa wantu wenda wakundigwe kutambaisa kuusu kia mbui wekugombekayo. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Kwaviya kwayada ugombekayo wendautaaziwe kuwa uyedi hemeso ya Muungu na kwa kugombeka wendauamuiwe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukunda ntangio</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maliko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Wamwe wa wahinyi wa Miko na Mafalisayo wakamwamba Yesu, “Mhinyi takunda kuona ntangio kulawa kwako.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Iya yee akawatambaisa, “Kivyazi chesacho kutama na cha ukianga chaondeza ntangio! Iya khakina chekhigwe ntangio iya ntangio wa Yona muoni wa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Kwaviya inga Yona ekuwavyo mwe ifu da samaki etangwae Nyangumi, nee ivyo Mwana wa Mntu endavyoekae asi ya sanga kwa misi mitatu kio na musi. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Wantu wa Ninawi wenda wagooke msi wa kuamuiwa hamwe na uvyazi unu na kuwaamuiiya, kwaviya wowo wayaeka mavigaviga kwa mabiikizi ya Yona, kauwa hanu yuaho ambae ni mkuu kusima Yona! <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Maikia wa kusini endaagooke kisingi cha uamuiyo na kukiamuiya kivyazi iki, kwaviya yee kalawiiya kisikiizi cha inusi, kutegeeza umanyi wa Selemani, akeza kutegeeza mbui za umanyi wa Selemani na aha yuaho ekuwae mkuu kusima Selemani.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kwa zaiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Zaiko dimlawaho mntu, daangadika angadika mwe hantu hesiho na mazi dikoondeza hantu hakuhumwiiza akini kadipata, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />aho egombekea mwenye, ‘Nenda niiuiye ida nyumba yangu nekulawayo.’ Iya auyaho na kuibwiiya ibue ihagiwa na kuhambwa vitana. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Aho, aita kuwaeta mazaiko mfungate wafyaimi kusima yee, nao wengia nakwekaa umo. Nae hali ya kisiikizi ya mntu yuda yatenda ya ufyaimi muno kusima ya bosi. Nee yendavyoiwe mwe uvyazi unu wa mavigaviga.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmaa na wanduguze da Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu ekuwaho atamwiiya na zumwezumwe da wantu, mami yakwe na wanduguze wakabua na kugooka chongoi na kukunda kutamwiiya nae. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Aho mntu yumwe akamwamba, “Mhinyi, mami yako na wanduguzo wagooka uko chongoi wakunda kutamwiiya nawe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Mmaa yangu nindai, na wandugu zangu ni wakina ndai?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Ahoaho akenua mkono kwa wahina wakwe, akagombeka, “Awa nee mmaa yangu na wandugu zangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Mana yoyose agosoae akundavyo Tate yangu wa uwanga kwa Muungu, uyo nee kaka yangu na umbu dangu na mmaa yangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Msimo wa muimi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Msi uwouwo Yesu akalawa mwe nyumba ida, akaita na kwekaa khandakhanda ya mazimshindo. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Zumwezumwe kuu da wantu wakamwekaiya bunga nee Yesu akakwea mwe ngaawa na kwekaa. Nawo wantu wose wakagooka khandakhanda ya mazimshindo, <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />nae Yesu akatamwiiya nawo mbui nyingi muno kwa misimo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Tegeezani, muimi kaita kuhanda mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Ekuwaho akahanda mbeyu mwe mnda, mbeyu ntuhu zikagwa khandakhanda ya sia, wadege wakeza na kuzida. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Ntuhu zikagwa hantu ha uwongo wekuwao uwanga ya iwe, ahoaho zikaoneka kuhota kwa kinyio. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Iya zua dekusomookaho, mitengea iyo ikahya na kwaviya mazindo yakwe khayokwengia asi muno, zikanyaa. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Mbeyu ntuhu zikagwa gatigati ya miwa, miwa iyo ikakuwa na kufintafinta ida mitengea. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Naho mbeyu ntuhu zikagwa he uwongo ntana, na mitengea yakwe ikavyaa khokoo makumi kumi na ntuhu makumi mtandatu na ntuhu makumi matatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Yesu akawamba, “Mwenye magutwi na ategeeze!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhinya kwa misimo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Naho wahina wakamtimia na kumuuza Yesu, “Kwa mbwai wagombeka na wantu kwa misimo?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Muungu kawekha nywie udaho wa kumanya sii za Useuta wakwe, akini wowo khamwekwekhigwa udaho wa kumanya ayo yose. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Mntu yeyose ambae amanya kuusu Useuta wa Muungu, Muungu endaamgosoe kwevana muno, iya mtu esayekumanya ata kidodo, Muungu endaadoe ata kiya kidodo akimanyacho. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Nagombeka nao kwa misimo, kwaajii wakauwa niyagosoayo, iya wegosoa khawaona, na wategeeza nihinyayo, iya wegosoa khawava. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Yaigania kwao yada ekugombekayo muoni Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Wantu awa wendawategeeze na kutegeeza akini khamnamnive;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Kukauwa mwenda mkauwe, wala khamnamuone,<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Kwaajii akii za wantu awa zihuuzuka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Waziba magutwi yao</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Meso yao wayafumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Ama khivyo nee woona kwa meso yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Nee wategeeza kwa magutwi yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Nee wamanya kwa akii zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Na kunihitukia agombeka Zumbe na miye nee kiwahonya.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Mwenda muwe na nyemi nywie, kwaviya meso yenu, kwaajii yakauwa na magutwi yenu kwaajii ya tegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Kwei nawamba, Waoni wangi na wantu wedi watamiwa kuyaona yada mwekuyaonayo nywie, iya khwekuyaona, na nee watamiwa muno kutegeeza yada myategeezayo iya khawekuyategeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asosoa msimo wa muimi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Naho tegeezani mana ya msimo wa yuda mntu ekuwaye ahanda mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Mntu yoyose ategeezae mbui inu ya Useuta wa Muungu kwesiho kuva, aigana na zia mbeyu zekugwazo siai. Yuda Ibiisi eza na kumhoka kia chekuhandwacho mwe moyo wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Ida mbeyu zekugwiswazo mwe uwongo wekuwao uwanga ya iwe ni mntu yuda ateegeeza Mbui ya Muungu na ahoaho huihokea kwa nyemi. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Iya kwaviya khana mazindo yenye udaho ndani yakwe, ida mbui yekaa kisingi kijihi. Ilawiiaho suuba hambu masuumizo kwaajii ya mbui iyo, yee afa maya. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Ida mbeyu yekugwayo mwe miwa ni yuda mntu ategeezae mbui, akini maangadiko ya inusi na usongeezi wa mai yaifintafinta ida mbui na kuigosoa yesekuvyaa matunda. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Ida mbeyu yekuhandwayo mwe uwongo mtana ni sawa na mntu ategeezae mbui iyo na kuiva, nae avyaa matunda, makumi kumi mtuhu makumi mtandatu na mtuhu makumi matatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa ndago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu akawamba wantu msimo mtuhu, “Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu waigana na mntu mwekuhanda mbeyu ntana mwe mnda wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Iya wantu wekuwaho wagona akeza mmasa wakwe akahanda ndago gatigati ya mnda wa uhemba, akaita. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Naho mbeyu zekuhotaho na mitengea ikakuwa na kuvoka kuvyaa, viyaviya ndago ikavoka kuoneka. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Wandima wa yuda mwenye mnda wakamwezea na kumwamba, ‘Mkuu khwekuhanda mbeyu ntana mweunu mnda wako? Inu ndago ilawiiya hahi?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Yee akawatambaisa ‘Mmasa nee mwekutenda ivyo.’ Wandima wakwe wakamuuza, ‘Ivi, wakunda tiite tikayang'oe?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Iya akagombeka ‘mwesekuita kuyausa kwaviya kisingi muusaho mainde, mwadaha kuusa ndago hamwe na uhemba.’ <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Ekani uhemba na mainde vikue vyose hamwe adi kisingi cha ubosi. Kisingi icho nenda niwambe wabosi, wavoke kuika hamwe mainde, wayafunge matitamatita yokwe moto wakabinda waike hamwe na uhemba na kuika mwe taa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa mbeyu yetangwayo haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu akawamba wantu msimo mtuhu, “Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu waigana na mbeyu yetangwayo haladali ekuidoayo mntu yumwe, akaihanda mwe mnda wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Mbeyu iyo ni ndodo kusima mbeyu zose, akini ihotaho yawa mtenge mkuu kusima mitengea yose, naho yakuwa na kutenda mti mkuu na wadege wawezea mti uwo na kuzenga masasa mwe matambi yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa hamila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20">Luka 13:20</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:21">21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu akawagombeka msimo mtuhu, “Useuta wa uwanga wa Muungu waigana na hamila ekudoayo mvyee yumwe, akaihanganya mwe madebe yakwe maidi ya unga wa ngano na hindi, ata unga wose ukaumuka.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwa mbwai Yesu atumia misimo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maliko 4:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu nee kawamba ayo zumwezumwe da wantu kwa misimo. Na khekuwamba dodose kwesiho misimo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Ili mbui yekugombekwayo na Muoni iiganie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Nenda nigombeke nao kwa misimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Nendaniyatamwiize yada yekufiswayo tangia kuumbwa kwa inusi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asosooa msimo wa mainde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Naho Yesu akadiaga dia zumwezumwe da wantu, akengia nyumbani. Wahina wakwe wakamtimia na kumwamba, “Tisosoee mana ya uda msimo wa mainde za mwe mnda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Mhasi wa zia mbeyu ntana ni Mwana wa Mntu, <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />uda mnda ni inusi. Zia mbeyu ntana ni wantu wada ambao Useuta ni wao. Akini yada mainde ni wada wantu wa Ibiisi, <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />mmasa mwe kuhanda ida mainde ni Ibiisi, ubosi ni kisikiizi cha inusi wabondaji ni wandima wa uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Inga viya muonavyo mainde yaikwavyo hamwe na kokwa moto, nee ivyo vyendavyo viwe mwe kisikiizi cha inusi. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana wa Mntu enda awaagiiye wandima wakwe wa uwanga kwa Muungu wawaike hamwe wantu kulawa mwe Useuta wakwe, na wada wose wawatendao wantu wagosoe mavigaviga na wada wose wagosoao ubanasi, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />na kuwatambika mwe tanuli da moto, na uko wendawaiye na kuuma meno kwaajii maumevu makai. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Naho wada wantu wekugosoayo yada yamtamiayo Muungu wendawang'ae inga zua mwe Useuta wa Tate yao. Mwenye magutwi na ategeeze!<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa kiikizo chekufiswacho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Useuta wa uwanga wa Muungu waigana na kiikizo chekufiswacho mwe mnda. Mntu yumwe ekuiyonaho akaifisa vituhu, akawa na kinyemi muno akenda kutaga vintu vyose ekuwavyo navyo, na akaugua uda mnda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa shanga zetangwazo lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Naho Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu waigana na mtabiashaa yumwe mwoondeza lulu ntana, <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />na ekupataho lulu mwenga ya hea nyingi muno, akenda kutaga vyose ekuwavyo navyo, akaigua ida lulu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa wavu wakulowa samaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Naho, Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu waigana na wavu wekwasigwao na walowa samaki mwe mazimshindo, ukagwiiya samaki wa kia mbai, <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Wekumemaho, wantu wakaubuuta adi khandakhanda ya mazimshindo, wakekaa na kuwasaguwa samaki watana na kuwaika mwe majumu yao na samaki wafyaimi wakasigwa.” <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Nee ivyo vyendavyoviwe kisikiizi cha inusi, wandima wa uwanga kwa Muungu wendawalawiiye, na kuwabahua wantu wafyaimi na wantu wedi, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />nakuwasa awo wafyaimi mwe tanuli da moto. Uko wendawaiye na kuuma meno kwa maumevu makai.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiikizo kihya na cha kae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu akawauza, “Ivi, mbui izi mzimanya zose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Wakamtambaisa, “Eehe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Nae akawamba, “Nee ivyo, kia mhinyi wa miko ya Musa awaye mhina wa Useuta wa Muungu aigana na mwenye kaya alavyae kiikizo chakwe cha vintu vihya na vya kae.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aemewa uko Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu ekubindaho kutamwiiya misimo iyo akahauka hantu aho, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />akaita mwe mzi wakwe. Uko akawa awahinya wantu mwe nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi ata wakahondomaa, wakamba, “Uyu kaipata hahi akii nyingi ivi,” wakauza, “Na udaho wa kugosoa vihii? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Uyu khio yuda mwana seemaa? Mami yakwe khio yuda etangwae Maliamu na wanduguze khio Yakobo na Yusufu na Simoni na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Naho umbuze wose khawekaa hamwe na swie? Naho khayapata hahi aya yose?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Wakamuemea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Iya Yesu akawamba, “Muoni atunywa na kia hantu kwesiho wantu wa mwe si yakwe na kaya kwakwe.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Nae khekugosoa vihii vingi uko, kwaajii ya kwesekuzumiiya kwao.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Ufe wa Yohana Mbatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Kisingi icho Seuta Helode ekuwae mgookezi wa si ya Galilaya nee kategeeza mbui za Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Akawagombeka wandima wakwe, “Uyo nee Yohana Mbatiiza, ekuyuyukae, nee mana ana udaho wakugosoa mbui za vihii uumo mwakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Helode nee kamgwiiya Yohana Mbatiiza akamzengeteza minyololo na akamwengiza mwe geeza kwaajii ya Helodia mkaza Filipo nduguye da Helode. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Kwaajii Yohana Mbatiiza kamwamba Helode, “Khio vitana kumdoa Helodia awe mkazio!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helode nee kakunda kumkoma Yohana Mbatiiza, iya nee akawaogoha Wayahudi, kwaajii wao wenye nee wakamanya kuwa Yohana Mbatiiza nekawa Muoni wa Muungu.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ata yekubuaho sikukhuu ya kuvyaigwa kwakwe Helode, mwana kindee wa Helodia akavina hemeso ya wageni wekugonekwao. Adi Helode akatamiwa muno, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />ata akaika kiaga kwa kuaha, “Nenda nikwekhe chochose wendacho uniombeze.”<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Uyo mndee nee kanchochewa kae na mami yakwe akamba. “Nekha mtwi wa Yohana Mbatiiza mwe chano!”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Seuta Helode akaungumia mwe moyo wakwe akini kwaajii ya kuaaha kwakwe hemeso ya wada wageni wekuwao he ntafuno akaagiiya ekhigwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Helode akaagiiya mntu kuda mwe geeza Yohana mbatiiza adumue mtwi. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Mtwi wake ukaetwa uikwa mwe chano, wakamwekha yuda mwana kindee, nae akamwegaiya mami yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Wahina wakwe Yohana Mbatiiza wakeza mwe geeza na kuudoa mwii wakwe na kuugea mwe mbia. Wekubindaho wakaita na kumwamba Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awekha khande wantu elufu shano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu ekusikiaho mbui ya Yohana Mbatiiza akahauka hantu hada kwa ngaawa, akaita hantu hesiho wantu yee ukedu. Wantu wakamtimia kwa miundi kulawa mwe mizi yao. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Aho ekuseaho khandakhanda ya mazimshindo akoona zumwezumwe kuu da wantu, akawafiiya mbazi na akawahonya watamu wao.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Zuwa dekuswaho wahina wakwe wakambasa na kugombeka, “Hantu aha khahana wantu wekaisao aha na saa zemboka kae. Agana na awa wantu ili waite mwe mizi wakeguiye khande.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Khawakundigwa kuhauka wekheni nywinywi khande.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Iya wao wakamtambaisa, “Tina mabumunda mashano na samaki waidi du.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu akawamba, “Nieteyani hanu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Akawakunda wantu wekae asi mwe mani. Yesu akayadoa yada mabumunda mashano na wada samaki waidi, akakauwa uwanga kwa Muungu, akavijaiya na kubendua yada mabumunda aho akawekha wahina wakwe ayo mabumunda na wada samaki, na wahina wakwe wakawekha wada wantu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Wantu wose wakada na kweguta. Aho wahina wakadodoa phuguntio, na wakamemeeza ngahu kumi dimwe na mbii. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Wantu wekudao ntaazia yao nee ni wagosi elufu shano kwesiho kutaazia wavyee na wana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu enda uwanga ya mazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ahoaho Yesu akawamba wahina wakwe wengie mwe ngaawa waongoe na kuita phande ya kaidi ya tondoo da mazi, kisingi yee aagana na zumwezumwe da wantu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Ekubindaho kuwaaga, akakwea mwe muima yee ukedu kuvika. Na yekubuwaho guoni yee nekekaa uko ikedu kidege, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />kwa kisingi icho ida ngaawa nee igatigati ya tondoo da mazi yakubwaniswa na mazi kwaajii khusi khai nee yaikindia ngaawa.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Kio, hehi na kucha, Yesu akawatimia wahina wakwe uku enda uwanga ya mazi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Wahina wakwe wekumwonaho akenda uwanga ya mazi wakaogoha muno, wakagombeka, “Ni mzimu!” Wakatoa vuzo kwa ukeng'enta.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Ahoaho Yesu akagombeka nao, “Twiiyani, ni miye, msekuogoha!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petulo akamwamba, “Zumbe, ikawa ni wee kwei, nambia nende uwanga ya mazi neze aho hako.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Soo!” Aho Petulo akaseeya mwe ida ngaawa, akenda uwanga ya mazi na kumtimia Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Akini ekuonaho khusi khai akengiwa ni matu nae akavoka kudidimia mwe mazi, uku atoa vuzo, “Zumbe niohoe!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Ahoaho Yesu akanyoosha mkono wakwe na kumtoza, akamwamba, “Wee mwenye uzumizi mcheche kwambwai kuwa na maatu?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Nao wekwengiaho mwe ngaawa, khusi ikaeka. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Wose wekuwao mda mwe ngaawa wakakinta mavindi na kwemwenamia na kugombeka, “Ni kwei wee ni Mwana wa Muungu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya watamu uko Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maliko 6:53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Wekubindaho kudumua tondoo da mazi, wakabua si ya Genesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Wantu wekummanyaho Yesu, wakaambaza mbui zakwe mwe si yose na mizi yekuwayo hehi na mzi uda, ivyo wakamwetea Yesu watamu wose. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Wakamwombeza awaekee wadonte msao wa nguo yakwe, na wose wekudontao wakahona.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya waongweezi wetu wa kae</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maliko 7:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Naho, Mafalisayo na wahinyi wa miko ya Musa wakabua kulawa Yelusalemu, wakamtimia Yesu na kumuuza, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Kwambwai wahina wako khawapatiiza mahinyo tekuyahokeayo kwa waongoweezi wetu wa kae? Khawasunta inga mazweeya yetu yakundavyo!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Kwambwai nywie nanywi khampatiiza miko ya Muungu iya mwayabasa mahinyo yenu wenye? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kwaviya Muungu kagombeka, ‘Na mntu yoyose amtunyae tati yake na mami yake na mntu yoyose amdumuae tati yakwe hambu mami yakwe, yakundigwa akomwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Iya nywie mwahinya inga mntu akawa na kintu ambacho chadaha kumwambiiza tati yakwe au mami yakwe, iya akamba, ‘Kintu iki ni cha Muungu,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />nywie wagombeka khudaha kumtunya tati yako kwa kumuambiiza kwa kumwekha kintu icho! Ivyo nee mbeavyo Mbui ya Muungu kwa kutongea mahinyo yenu wenye.<verse eid="MAT 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Nywie wabakha! Muoni Isaya kaambiza vyedi kwenu nywinywi,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Muungu amba Wantu awa wanitunya kwa ntamwiizi zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">Iya mwe mioyo yao wahae na miye.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Kunivika kwao khakuwaambiiza dodose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">Kwaviya mahinyo wahinyayo ni wantu ni du wekuyagoayo wao wenye!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbui zimtendazo mntu asekuzumiiwa kuwa hemeso ya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maliko 7:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu akawetanga wada zumwezumwe da wantu, akagombeka, “Tegeezani, na mnive! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Kintu kimtendacho mntu asekuzumiiwa kuwa he meso ya Muungu khio via vyengiavyo mwe muomo, iya ntamwiizi zimlawazo mwe muomo. Ivyo nee vimtendavyo mntu asekuzumiiwa kuwa he meso ya Muungu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Aho wahina wakambasa nakumwamba, “Ivi, wamanya kuwa Mafalisayo wakimwa muno wekutegeezaho mbui zako?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Kintu chochose ambacho Tate yangu wa uwanga kwa Muungu khekuhanda chendaking'olwe.” <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Wabadeni wenye, wowo ni matuntu na waongweeya matuntu. Inga tuntu akamwongoeya tuntu mweziwe, wose waidi wendawengiye mwe tubwi.<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petulo akamba, “Tisosoee msimo uwo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu akawamba, “Hata nywie khammanya? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Ivi khammanya kuwa kia chengiacho kanwai chengia mweifu na kulavigwa chongoi na kuita nkii? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Iya mbui zilawazo kanwai zalawa mwe moyo na mbui izo nee zimtendazo mntu asekuzumiiwa kuwa he meso ya Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kwaviya umo mwe moyo wa mntu kwalawa fanyanyi za ufyaimi na ukomaji na ukianga na kianga na ubavi na ugombekaji wa uhokho na kuwagombekea watuhu mafyaimi. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ayo nee yamtendayo mntu asekuzumiiwa ni Muungu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmaa kulawa si ya Kanaani azumiiaye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maliko 7:24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu akahauka hantu hada akaita mwe si ambazo ni hehi na mizi ya Tilo na Sidoni, <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Aho mvyee yumwe ekuwae ni mkanaani ambae nee kawa akekaa mwe si iyo akamtimia Yesu, nakutoa mgutio, “Zumbe, Mwana wa Daudi, unifiiye mbazi! Mwanangu wa kivyee apishwapishwa ni mazaiko.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Iya Yesu khekumwandua mbui yoyose. Aho, wahina wakwe wakambasa Yesu, na kumwamba, “Umwambe aite kwaviya atibasabasa na kutitoeya vuzo!”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Khiagiiwa kwaajii ya wantu wa si ya Isilaeli wakwagao inga ngoto.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Iya yuda mmaa akeza na kukinta mavindi hemeso ya Yesu na kumwamba, “Zumbe, niambiize!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Khio vitana kudoa khande ya wana na kuwatambikia makui.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Yuda mmaa akamtambaisa, “Ni kwei Zumbe, akini hata makui yada phuguntio zigwiswazo kulawa he meza za mazumbe wao.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Aho Yesu akamtambaisa, “Mmaa uzumizi wako ni mkuu na itende inga wekukundavyo.” Yuda mdee akahona kisingi ichoicho.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awahonya wantu wangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu akahauka na kuita khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi ya Galilaya. Aho akakwea mwe muima akekaa uko. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Zumwezumwe kuu da wantu dikamwezea, wakamuetea wantu wekuviao na matuntu na wekuviao miundi na mabubu na watuhu watamu wangi, wakawaika hemeso yakwe Yesu nae akawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Awo wantu wakahondomaa wekuonaho mabubu watamwiiya na wekuviao miundi wenda na matuntu waona, wantu wakamtogoa Muungu wa wantu wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awekha khande wantu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliko 8:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Aho Yesu akawetanga wahina wakwe akagombeka, “Nawafiiya mbazi wantu awa kwaajii wawa na miye misi mitatu, naho khawana khande. Khikunda kuwabada waite na saa, wasekweza kugwa msae siai.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Wahina wakwe wakamwamba, “Hantu hanu khahana wantu, tendatiipatie kuhi khande ya kuigania wantu wose awa?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu akawauza, “Mnayo mabumunda mangahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Wakamtambaisa, “Tinayo mabumunda mfungate na visamaki vidodo naho ni vicheche.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Aho akawamba wada wantu wekae asi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Akayadoa yada mabumunda mfungate na via visamaki vicheche, akamtogoa Muungu, akavibendua, akawekha wahina, nao wakawapangia wada wantu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Wose wakada na kweguta. Wahina wakwe wakaika hamwe phuguntio vya vyekusigaavyo wakamemeeza ngahu mfungate. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Awo wekudao nee wawa wagosidu elufu nne kwesaho kutaazia wavyee na wana.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Aho, Yesu akaagana na wada wantu akengia mwe ngaawa, akaita phande za Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wakunda ntangio na vihii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maliko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Mafalisayo na Masadukayo wakamwezea Yesu, na kumgeeza kwa kumwoombeza awagosoee ntangio kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Akawatambaisa akawamba, “Ibuaho guoni mwagombeka, ‘Hali ya hewa yendaiwe ni ntana kwaviya maangwi ni mekhundu.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na keokeo mwagombeka, ‘Ivyeo fua yendainye kwaajii ni yasize nahodu mazunde yatanda.’ Naho nywie mwamanya muno kusoma misimu na kuikauwa hali ya uwanga, iya khammanya ntangio zilawiiyazo kisingi iki. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Kivyazi cha wantu wabanasi na chesacho kuwa na uzumizi! Chakunda ntangio, akini khakina chekhigwe ntangio yoyose, iya ida ntangio ya Yona, Yesu akawabada, akaita.”<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamila ya Mafalisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maliko 8:14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Wahina wakwe wekubuaho phande ya kaidi ya tondoo da mazi, wakakumbuka wajaa kudoa mabumunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu akawamba, “Kauwani, na muiyemee hamila ya Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Akini wakauzana wowo kwa wowo, “Tambe agombeka ivyo kwakuwa khatekudoa mabumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu akamanya yada wekuwayo watamwiiya akawamba, “Nywie wantu wenye uzumizi mdodo! Kwambwai mwauzanauzana kwa kwesekuwa na mabumunda <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Ivi khamzati kuniva? Khamkumbuka nekubenduaho yada mabumunda mashano kwaajii ya wada wantu elufu shano? Mmemeeza ngahu nyingahi ya vyekusigaavyo? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Hambu yada mabumunda mfungate wekudao wada wantu elufu nne, nee mwiika hamwe ngahu nyingahi ya vyekusigaavyo. <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Kwambwai mwavotwa kumanya miye nchekuwa nikatamwiiya mbui ya mabumunda? Ekauweni na hamila ya Mafalisayo na Masadukayo!”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Aho wahina wakamanya kuwa kawamba waemee khio hamila ya mabumunda, iya mahinyo ya Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo agombeka pwii kuwa Yesu ni Mwana wa Muungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maliko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu ekubuaho phande za Kaisalia Filipi, akawauza wahina wakwe, “Wantu wagombeka Mwana wa Mntu kuwa nindai?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Wakamtambaisa, “Watuhu wamba ni Yohana Mbatiiza na watuhu wamba ni Eliya na watuhu wamba ni Jelemia hambu yumwe wa Waoni.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu akawauza, “Ivi, nywinywi mwambaze, miye nindai?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petulo akamtambaisa, “Wee nee Klistu, Mwana wa Muungu ekuwaye na ugima.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu akagombeka, “Wenda uwe na nyemi Simoni mwana wa Yona, kwaviya khahana mntu yoyose mwekukugubwiiya mbui inu, iya Tate yangu wa uwanga kwa Muungu ekukugubuiaye mbui izi. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Ivyo nakwamba, wee nee Petulo na uwanga ya iwe idi nendanizenge zumwezumwe da wantu wamzumiiyao Klistu, na udaho wa ufe khaunaudahe kudivota. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Nendanikwekhe funguo za Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu, na dodose wendadoudivugae mwe inusi dendadiwe divugalwa uko uwanga kwa Muungu, na dodose wendado udivugue mwe inusi dendadiwe divugulwa uko uwanga kwa Muungu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Aho akawaemeza wahina wakwe wasekumwamba mntu yoyose kuwa yee nee mwekusagulwa ni Muungu.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu egombekea usuumizi hamwe na ufe wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Maliko 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Tangia kisingi icho Yesu akavoka kuwamanyisa pwii wahina wakwe, kuwa nakundigwa niite Yelusalemu na uko nendanekhigwe usuumizi mwingi kulawa kwa wadaa na Waviki wakuu na wahinyi wa miko na nendanikomwe, na msi wa ntatu nendaniyuyuke.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Aho Petulo akamdoa khandai akavoka kumwakia Yesu, “Zumbe isekuwa ivyo, mbui iyo khaina ikubwiiye!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Yesu akahituka na kumwamba Petulo, “Hauke he meso yangu, Ibiisi! Wee ukikindio changu. Moyo wako khaumamakanya yekuwayo ya Muungu iya ya wantu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Aho Yesu akawamba wahina wakwe, “Mntu yoyose akakunda kunitongea yakundigwa eemee mwenye na audoe mhamba wakwe anitongee. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Kwaviya mntu akakunda kuuhonya ugima wakwe mwenye, endaawaze, <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />na mntu endae awaze ugima wakwe kwaajii yangu endaekhigwe. Ivi, mntu endaafaidike mbwai akekhigwa vintu vyose vya inusi uku akawaza ugima wakwe? Hambu mntu endaalavye kintu chani kiwe badala yakwe? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kwaviya, Mwana wa Mntu endaeze na udeeko wa Tati yakwe hamwe na wandima wa uwanga kwa Muungu na aho ndiho endahoamwiihe kiya mntu kwa kadii ya ntendwa zakwe. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nawamba kwei, wauko watuhu hanu ambao khawana wauye na nyuma kabla ya kumoona Mwana wa Mntu akeza mwe useuta wakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahituka cheni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maliko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Yekwembokaho misi mtandatu, Yesu akawadoa Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana nduguye akaita nao hadi uwanga ya muima uko nee wawa ikedu. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Wekuwaho uko Yesu akahituka cheni hemeso yao. Cheni chakwe kikang'ang'azika inga zuwa na magwanda yakwe yakang'ang'azika inga ung'azi. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Naho wada wahina watatu nee wawaona Musa na Eliya wakatamwiiya na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Aho Petulo akamwamba Yesu, “Zumbe, nivitana sie kuwa hanu! Ukakunda nendanizenge makumbi matatu. Dimwe dako na dimwe da Musa na kitudu cha Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Ekuwaho bado agombeka, zunde dekung'aado dikawagubika, na mgutio ukategeezeka kulawa mwe dia zunde, “Uyu ni Mwanangu nimkundisae, nitamiwae nae, mtegeezeni yee.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Wahina wekutegeezavyo ivyo, nee wakagwa asi na kugonea maifu, wakaogoha muno <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yesu akawezea akawadonta, akawamba, “Gookani msekuogoha!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Wekukauwaho uwanga khawekumwona mntu mtuhu, iya Yesu ikedu.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Aho wekuwaho waseeya mwe muima Yesu akawaemeza, “Wasekumwamba mntu mbui wekuonazo adi Mwana wa Mntu endaho ayuyuke.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Aho wahina wakamuuza, “Kwa mbwai wahinyi wa miko wagombeka kuwa yakundigwa Eliya avoke kweza?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Ni kwei, yakundigwa Eliya avoke kweza na kuika vitana mbui zose.” <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Akini nawamba Eliya keza kae, iya wantu khawekummanya, iya wakamgosoeya mbui za ufyaimi inga wakundavyo. Viyaviya Mwana wa Mntu enda asuumizwe mwe mikono yao.<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Aho awo wahina wakamanya kuwa nee akawamba mbui za Yohana Mbatiiza.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mbwanga mwenye mazaiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maliko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luka 9:37-43a</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Wekudibwiiyaho vituhu dia zumwezumwe da wantu, mntu yumwe akamwezea Yesu na kumkintia mavindi, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />akagombeka, “Zumbe mfiiye mbazi mwanangu kwaviya agwa mtwi naho asumiiya muno, maa nyingi agwa mwe moto na mwe mazi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Khiwaetea wahina wako iya khawekudaha kumhonya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Nywie wantu wa kivyazi iki chesacho kuzumiiya, chekuatukacho! Nenda nekae na nyie adi ini? Nendaniwazizimize ata ini? Mweteni hanu uyo mbwanga.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Aho Yesu akadiwakia ido zaiko nado dikamlawa yuda mbwanga akahona kisingi kia kia. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Aho wahina wakwe wakamtimia Yesu hantu kwesiho wantu, wakamuuza, “Kwa mbwai sie khatokudaha kumlavya yuda zaiko?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu akawatambaisa kwaajii ya uzumizi wenu mdodo. Nawamba kwei, ati nee muwa na uzumizi inga khokhoo ya haladali nee mkawamba muima unu hauke aha uite hada, nao wendauhauke. Ivyo khahana mbui yoyose yesayokudahika kwenu. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Mbui inga inu khaidahika iya kwa kuvika na kwa kwehiniza kuda.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agombeka vituhu mbui ya ufe wakwe na kuyuyuka kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Yesu ekuwaho na wahina wakwe uko Galilaya akawamba, “Mwana wa Mntu enda alavigwe kwa wantu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Nao wenda wamkome na msi wa ntatu enda ayuyuke.” Wahina wakwe wakaungumia muno.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiha kodi ya Nyumba ya Muungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Yesu na wahina wakwe wekubuwaho Kapelanaumu, wadoao kodi he Nyumba ya Muungu wakamwezea Petulo na kumuuza, “Wee, ivi mhinyi yenu khaiha kodi ya Nyumba ya Muungu?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petulo akatambaisa, “Eehe yee aiha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Aho, Petulo ekwengiaho mda ndani ya nyumba hata khazati kutamwiiya mbui, Yesu akavoka kumuuza, “Simoni, wee waona viivihi? Maseuta wa inusi wadoa kodi kulawa kwa kinandai? Kulawa kwa wantu wa si yao hambu kwa wageni?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petulo akatambaisa, “Kulawa kwa wageni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu akamwamba, “Inga ni ivyo wenye si yao khawakundigwa kuiha kodi. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Iya khatikunda kuwasefua moyo, hita mwe tondoo da mazi ukatambike ndoano, samaki wa bosi endaeatozwe mgubue muomo wakwe wenda umbwiiye heya idoe ukaihe kodi yako na yangu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Mkuu nindai?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Kisingi kiya wahina wakamwezea Yesu, na kumuuza, “Nindai mkuu muno mwe useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu akamwetanga mwana mdodo na kumgoosa gatigati yao, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Aho akawagombeka, “Nawamba kwei, mkesekuhituka na kuwa inga wana khamnamwengiye katu mwe useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Kwaiyo mntu yoyose ajinyenyeekeshae inga mwana uyu, nee endae awe mkuu kusima wose mwe useuta wa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Yuda amhokeaye mwana kwaajii yangu, endaawe anihokea miye.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwahosa watuhu kugosoa mavigaviga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maliko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Iya inga mntu yoyose mwendae amtende yumwe wa wadodo awa wanizumiiao agosoe mavigaviga, ni ebae mntu uyo azengetezwe iwe kuu da kubundugia mwe singo yakwe na kutambikwa mwe kina kilehacho cha mazimshindo.<figure style="fig" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" ref="18:6">Wantu waidi wabunduga kwa kutumia iwe da kubundugia</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Mmbwii yenu wantu wa Inusi inu kwaajii ya yada yaetayo wantu kugosoa mavigaviga! Mbui izo nlazima yawe aho, iya mmbwii yakwe mntu yuda ambae endaagosoe.<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Inga mkono hambu muundi wako ukakutenda kugosoa mavigaviga usenge na uwase hae. Ni ebae kwako kwengia mwe ugima kwesiho mkono hambu muundi, kusima kwasigwa mwe moto wesao kukomeka misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi ukawa na mikono miidi na miundi yako miidi. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Na ziso dako dikakutenda ugosoe mavigaviga, ding'oe na kudasa hae. Ni ebae kwako kwengia mwe ugima ukawa na ziso dimwe kusima kwengia mwe moto misi yose kwesaho kukomeka ukawa na meso yako yose maidi.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa ngoto mwekwaga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Ekauweni, msekumbea wamwe wa wadodo awa. Kwaviya nawamba, wandima wao wa uko uwanga kwa Muungu, misi yose wahamwe na Tate yangu uko uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Kwaviya Mwana wa Mntu keza kuohoa wada wakwagao.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Mwaona viivihi? Mntu akawa na ngoto makumi kumi, akaga yumwe endaatende viivihi? Ivi khana awabade wada makumi kenda na kenda kwe muima, na nakuita kumwondeza yuda yumwe mwekwaga? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Nawamba kwei endaho amuone, endaawe na nyemi nae uyo kusima wada makumi kenda na kenda ambao khawekwaga. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Ivyoivyo na Tate yangu wa uwanga kwa Muungu khakunda hata yumwe wa wadodo awa age.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumhaza nduguyo ekukugosoeaye masa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Nduguyo mkese kwevana, umbase na umhaze mkawa nywie waidi du. Akakutegeeza wendauwe nduguyo kumpata. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ikawa ata khekukutegeeza doa mtu yumwe hambu waidi, inga Maandiko yagombekavyo, ‘kia masa yendayaonoke kuwa ni kwei kwa uvuhuzi wa wantu waidi hambu watatu, masa yaamulwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Akese kuwategeeza awo wavuhuzi waidi hambu watatu, wagombeke zumwezumwe da wantu wekumzumiiyao Klistu. Na inga khanaaditegeeze zumwezumwe da wantu wamzumiiao Klistu na awe kwako inga wantu wesao kummanya Muungu hambu watozao ushuu.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvugua na kuvugaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Kwei nawamba, mbui mwendazomzivugue mwe inusi zendazivugalwe na uko uwanga kwa Muungu, na mbui zendazomzivugae mwe inusi zendazivugulwe na uko uwanga kwa Muungu.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Nawagombekea vituhu waidi gatigati yenu wakevana hanu he inusi kuusu mbui yoyose waiyombezayo, Tate yangu wa uko uwanga endaagosoe mbui iyo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kwaviya hohose hada wakintanaho waidi hambu watatu kwa zina dangu, miye ni ahoaho gatigati yao.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa mndima mwesekuekea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Naho Petulo akamwezea Yesu na kumuuza, “Zumbe, ndugu yangu akaendeea kunikosea maa nyingahi na miye nimfiiye mbazi? Hambu, ata maa mfungate?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Khigombeka maa mfungate iya mfungate maa makumi mfungate.” <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Kwaivyo Useuta wa Muungu wadaha kuiganywa na seuta yumwe mwe kukunda kugosoa ntaazia ya hea na wandima wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ekuvokaho kugosoa ntaazia zakwe mntu yumwe mwekuwa adaiwa vifuko magana kumi vya zahabu, akaetwa kwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Ekuvotwaho kuiha deni ido, ivyo seuta yake akakunda yee atagwe na mkaziwe atagwe hamwe na wanawe watagwe na vyose ekuwavyo navyo vitagwe ili dia deni diihwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Yuda mndima akakinta mavindi na kumhembeeza yuda seuta na kugombeka, “unizizimizie, nami nenda nikuihe deni dako dose.” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Yuda Mkuu wa uyo mndima akamfiiya mbazi na akamuekea deni dakwe dose akambada aite zakwe.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Iya uyo mndima ekuwaho alawa chongoi, akakintana na mndima ekuwae amdai ntii makumi kumi ya madini yetangwayo feza. Akamfuntia na kumkeda kongomeo na kumwamba niihe kia nikudaiacho. <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Yuda mndima mweziwe akakinta mavindi na kumhembeeza akagombeka, ‘Naombeza unizizimize, nami nendanikuihe deni dako dose.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Akini akaemea na akamwegaa he kifungo hadi endahoaihe ido deni. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Wandima weziwe wekuonaho ayo yekuawiiayo wakakimwa muno, nao wakaita nakumgombeka seuta yao kiya kintu chekulawiiacho. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Aho yuda seuta akamwetanga yuda mndima, akamwamba, ‘wee ni mndima mfyaimi muno! Kuniombeza nikakufiiya mbazi na miye nikakufiiya mbazi deni dako dose.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ivi weye, khwekukundigwa kumfiiya mbazi mndima mwezio inga nekukufiiavyo mbazi? <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Aho, uyo seuta akakimwa muno akamwekhiiza kwa asikai mageeza wamsuumize adi endahoaihe deni dose.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Na Yesu akaedeea kugombeka, “Tate yangu wa uwanga kwa Muungu nee endavyoawagoswee ivyo inga kia yumwe yenu khana amfiiye mbazi nduguye kwa moyo wakwe wose.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahinya mahinyo ya talaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maliko 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu ekubindaho kutamwiiya mbui izo, akahauka Galilaya akaita Uyahudi, phande ya zigizigi da mazi da Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Zumwezumwe da wantu dikamtongea, nae akawahonya uko.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Mafalisayo wakamwezea, wakamuuza kwa kumgeeza, “Vyafaa mgosi kumbada mkaziwe kwa masa yoyose?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Khamwekusoma mwe Maandiko ya Muungu kuwa Muungu mwe kumuumba mntu, kuvokea aho bosi kagosoa mgosi na mvyee, <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />na akagombeka, ‘Kwaajii uyo mgosi endaabadane na tati yakwe na mami yakwe, na endaaungane na mkaziwe, nao awa waidi wenda wawe mwii umwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Kwaivyo, wowo khio waidi vituhu iya ni mwii umwe. Ivyo ekukintanisacho Muungu mntu asekukibahua.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Akini wowo wakamuuza, “Kwambwai Musa katiagiiya mvyee ekhigwe bauwa na kubadwa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu akawatambaisa, Musa kawekha uhusa kuwabada wavyee wenu kwaajii mioyo yenu itoga. Iya khayokuwa ivyo kuvokea aho bosi. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Na isasa nawambeni, yoyose ambadae mkaziwe kwesiho mbui ya ukianga na akategua mvyee mtuhu agosoa kianga.<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Wahina wakwe wakamwamba, “Ikawa mbui ya mgosi na mvyee niivyo, ni ebae mtu asekutegua.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu akawamba, “Khio wose wadahao kuhokea hinyizo idi, kwesiho kwa wada ambao Muungu kawaambiza kugosoa ivyo. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kwaviya wauko mabunyenge wekuvyaigwao na mami zao na wauko mabunyenge wekugosolwao na wantu na wauko mabunyenge wekwetendao kuwa mabunyenge kwaajii ya Useuta wa Muungu. Adahae kuhokea hinyizo ido na aihokee.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awajaiya wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Wamwe wa wantu wakamwetea wana wadodo awaikie mikono na kuwavika. Akini wahina wakawawakia. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu akagombeka “Waekeni awo wana weze hangu, naho msekuwakindia, kwaviya Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu ni wa wantu wekuwao inga wana awa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ekubindaho kuwaikia mikono nee ahauka hantu aho.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwanga mwenye vintu vingi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Mntu yumwe akamwezea Yesu akamwamba, “Mhinyi, nigosoe mbui yani yedi nekhigwe ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Mbona waniuza kuusu mbui yedi? Kuna yumwedu ambae ni yedi. Ukakunda kwengia mwe ugima toza amli.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Yuda mntu akamuuza, “Amli ni zihi?” Yesu akamwamba, “Usekukoma na usekugosoa kianga na usekubawa na wesekugombeka uhokho, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />watunye tati yako na mami yako na mkunde mwezio inga wekundavyo mwenye.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Uyo mbwanga akamwamba, “Ayo yose khiyatozeeza. Ivi khihungukiwa na mbwai?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu akamwamba, “Inga ukakunda kuwa mwiganizi, hita ukatage vintu vyako vyose na izo hea ukawekhe wakiwa, nawe wendauwe na kiikizo uwanga kwa Muungu, ukabinda soo unitongee.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Yuda mbwanga ekusikiaho ayo, akahauka kwa kuungumia kwaajii nekawa na vintu vingi.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Aho Yesu akawamba wahina wakwe, “Kwei nawamba indaiwe khavidahika muno kwa mwenye vintu vingi kwengia mwe Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Naho nawamba ni vihufu ngamia kwemboka mwe ntundu ya singano kusima mwenye vintu vingi kwengia mwe Useuta wa Muungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Wada wahina wakwe wekusikiaho ivyo wakahondomaa muno wakauzana, “Nindai adahae kuoholwa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu akawakauwa, akagombeka, “Kwa mntu mbui inu khaidahika, iya kwa Muungu mbui zose zadahika.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Aho Petulo akagombeka, “Na swiswi tibada vyose takutongea, tinda tipate mbwai?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu akawamba, “Nawamba kwei, Mwana wa Mntu endahoekae mwe kigoda kikuu cha Useuta mwe inusi mphya, nywinywi mwekunitongeao mnda mwekae mwe vigoda kumi dimwe na mbii mkaamuiya mbai kumi dimwe na mbii ya Isilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Kiya mwekubada nyumba yakwe, hambu ndugu yakwe hambu umbu dakwe hambu tati yakwe hambu mmaa yakwe hambu wanawe hambu minda yakwe kwaajii yangu, endaahokee mamia na ngeeko, na kwekhigwa ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Iya ambao ni wabosi wendawawe wa kisikiizi na ambao ni wa kisikiizi wendawawe wa bosi.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Msimo wa waimi mwe mnda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu waigana na mntu mwenye mnda wa mizabibu, mwekulawa keokeo da mtungaihu kwaajii ya kuwekha waimi ndima mwe mnda wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Akevana nao kuwaiha sensi mwenga ya madini yetagwayo feza kwa msi umwe, nee awegaa mwe mnda wakwe wa mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Akalawa mwe saa tantu da keo akawabwiiya wantu watuhu wagooka gwiiyo, khawana ndima, <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />akawagombeka, ‘Hitani na nywie mkagosoe ndima mwe mnda wangu wa mizabibu, na miye nenda niwekhe kiya kikundigwacho kuihwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Nawo wakaita. Uyo mwenye mnda akalawa vituhu mwe saa mtandatu na saa kenda, akatenda ivyo. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Ata zua dekuswaho akalawa vituhu akawabwiiya wantu watuhu wagooka hada gwiiyo. Aho akawauza, ‘Mbona mgooka hanu musi ngima kwesiho ndima?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Wakamtambaisa, ‘Kwaviya khahana mntu mwekutekha ndima.’ Nae akawamba, ‘Hitani na nywie mkagosoe ndima mwe mnda wangu wa mizabibu.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Zua dekuswaho, uyo mwenye mnda akamwamba mgookezi wakwe, ‘Wetange wandima uwahihe maiho yao, uvoke na wada wekugosoao ndima mda wa kisikiizi na uwabindiizie wada wekuvokaho ndima.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Wada wandima wakeza wada wekugosoao ndima zua diswa kae wakahokea kia yumwe maiho ya sensi mwenga ya madini yetangwayo feza. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Wada wa bosi wekubuaho, wakamamakhanya wenda wekhigwe na ngeeko, akini hata wowo wakekhigwa sensi mwenga mwenga ya madini yetangwayo feza. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Wakahokea yada maiho na kuvoka kumng'ung'uzikia yuda mwenye mnda. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Wakamba, ‘Wantu awa weza guoni na wagosoa ndima kwa mda wa saa dimwe du, mbona kutiiha sawa nao, kisingi swie tizizimiza ndima ngumu na zua kai?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Naho yuda mwenye mnda akamtambaisa yumwe aho, ‘Mbuyangu nchekukukonya kintu! Ivi, tambe khatekwevana kuwaiha misi yose maiho ya sensi mwenga kwa msi umwe? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Doa kiya wekukundigwacho kuihwa na uite. Nakunda kumwekha uyu wa kisikiizi inga nikukuihavyo wee. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Ivi khikundigwa kugosoa kiya nikundacho na ni vintu vyangu mwenye? Hambu waona kinyuu kwa viya khiwa yedi?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yesu akabindiizia kwa kugombeka, “Ivyo, wakisikiizi wendawawe wa bosi na wabosi wendawawe wa kisikiizi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agombeka maa ya ntatu mbui ya ufe na uyuyuko wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu ekuwaho akaita Yelusalemu hamwe na wahina wakwe wangi, na wekuwaho siai akawadoa wada wahina wakwe kumi dimwe na mbii kuwegaa khandani na kutamwiia nawo wowo ikedu, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Tegeezani! Taita Yelusalemu na uko Mwana wa Mntu endaekhiizwe kwa waviki wakuu na wahinyi wa miko, nao wendawamuamuiye akomwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Wenda wamwekhiize kwa wantu wesao kuwa Wayahudi, nawo wendawambee na endaatoigwe ngoda na kusuumizwa na kugong'ondewa he mhamba, iya bada ya misi mitatu endaayuyuswe.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmaa akunda wanawe wekhigwe ukuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maliko 10:35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Aho mkaza Zebedayo hamwe na wanawe waidi ambao ni Yakobo na Yohana wakamwezea Yesu, wakakinta mavindi hemeso yakwe na kumwombeza kintu. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu akamuuza, “Wakunda mbwai?” Uyo mmaa akamtambaisa, “Niikia kiaga wendaho wengie mwe Useuta wako, awa wanangu waidi nakunda wekae, yumwe phande yako ya kuume na mtuhu phande yako ya kumoso.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Khammanya mwaombeza mbwai. Ivi mwadaha kudomea kikombe iki cha usuumizi nendacho nidomee miye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Wakatambaisa, “Tadaha.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu akawamba, “Kwei kikombe changu cha masuumizo mwenda mkidomee, iya kwekaa phande ya kuume hambu kumoso kwangu iyo khiyo ndima yangu kuwekha, mbui iyo wendawekhigwe wada wekuikiwao kae ni Tate yangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Wada wahina watuhu kumi dimwe wekutegeezaho ayo, wakakimwa kwaajii ya awo ndugu waidi. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Ivyo Yesu akawetanga wose, na akawamba, “Mwamanya kuwa wagookezi wa si ntuhu uwagookea wantu wao kwa nguvu na wakuu wao wawatumikisha wekuwao asi yao. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Iya kwenu isekuwa ivyo, na mntu akundae kuwa mkuu gatigati yenu yakundigwa awe mndima wa wose, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />na akundae kuwa wa bosi gatigati yenu, akundigwa awe mndima yenu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Inga ivyoivyo, Mwana wa Mntu khekweza kugosoewa, iya kuwagosoea na kuulavya ugima wakwe na ili wantu wangi waoholwe.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awahonya matuntu waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:47-52">Maliko 10:47-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Kisingi Yesu na wahina wakwe wekuwaho wakahauka mwe mzi wa Yeliko, zumwezumwe kuu da wantu dikamtongea. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Matuntu waidi wekuwao wekaa khandakhanda ya sia, wekusikiaho kuwa Yesu emboka aho, wakatoa mgutio, “Zumbe, Mwana Daudi utifiiye mbazi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Dia zumwezumwe da wantu dikawaegezea na kuwakunda wanyamae. Iya wowo wakatendesa kutoa mgutio, “Zumbe, Mwana wa Daudi utifiiye mbazi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu akagooka, akawetanga na kuwauuza, “Mwaonda niwagoswee mbwai?” <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Wakamtambaisa, “Zumbe, takunda meso yetu yagubuke.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu akawafiiya mbazi na kuyadonta meso yao, ahoaho meso yao yakadaha kuona, na wao wakamtongea.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu engia mzi wa Yelusalemu kwa kinyemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu na wahina wakwe wekubuaho hehi na Yelusalemu na kubua hantu hetangwaho Betifage mwe muima wa Mizaituni, akawaagiiya wahina wakwe waidi, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />akawamba, “Hitani adi mwe mzi weiho hemeso yenu na aho mwendamumbwiiye phunda kazengetezwa uzigi na mwanawe kazengetezwa uzigi khandai yakwe wavugueni mkawaete. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Inga mntu akawauza kwambwai mwawadoa phunda, mmwambe, Zumbe awakunda, na mwenye phunda endaawekhe kinyio.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Mbui inu igosoka ili yada yekugombekwayo na Muoni wa Muungu yaiganyie,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Wagombekeni wantu wa mzi wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Kauwa, Seuta yako akwezea!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Ni mhuhusi, nae eza akawa kekaa uwanga ya phunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Mwana phunda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ivyo wada wahina wakaita wakagosoa inga Yesu ekuwaagiiavyo. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Wakamweta yuda phunda na mwanawe, wakatandika nguo zao uwanga ya phunda na Yesu akekaa uwanga yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Zumwezumwe kuu da wantu wakatandaza nguo zao mwe sia na wantu watuhu wakasenga matambi madodo dodo ya miti nayo wakayatandaza mwe sia. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Zumwezumwe da wantu wekuongoao na wada wamtongeao wakatoa mgutio, “Atogolwe Mwana wa Daudi! Ajaiwe uyo ezae kwa zina da Zumbe! Atogolwe Muungu uwanga!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu ekwengiaho Yelusalemu mzi wose wakawa na matumatu. Wantu wakawa wauzana, “Uyu ni nindai?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Wantu mwe dia zumwezumwe wakagombeka, “Uyu ni Yesu, yuda muoni kulawa Nazaleti mzi wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aita he Nyumba ya Muungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Aho, Yesu akengia he Nyumba ya Muungu, na kuwaguusa wose wekuwao wakagua na kutaga vintu he Nyumba ya Muungu. Akazihitua meza za wada wekuwao wahitua hea, na vigoda vya wada wekuwao wataga sua. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Akawamba, “Iyandikwa mwe Maandiko ya Muungu, ‘Nyumba yangu indaiwe nyumba ya kuvika.’ Iya nywie mwiitenda phanga da wabavi!”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Wantu wekuwao matuntu na wekuviao wakambasa uko kwe Nyumba ya Muungu, nae Yesu akawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Aho, waviki wakuu na wahinyi wa miko wakakimwa muno wekuonaho vihii ekugosoavyo Yesu hamwe na kuwategeeza wana wekuwavyo walavya mgutio kwe Nyumba ya Muungu wakamba, “Atogolwe Mwana Daudi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Ivyo wakamwamba, “Ivi, wategeeza wambavyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesu akawatambaisa, “Eehe, nategeeza!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Ivi khamzati kusoma Maandiko aya? “Kwa miomo ya wana wadodo na wateke, Muungu kawagosoa wamtogoe yee.”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Aho Yesu akawabada, akalawa chongoi ya mzi na kuita mwe phaamo ya Besania, na akagona uko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aubadia lazi mti wetangwao mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maliko 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Keokeo da mtungaihu Yesu ekuwaho auya mwe mzi neekawa na saa. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Akoona mtini khandakhanda ya sia, akautimia hehi, akini khekuona tunda dodose iya manidu. Ahoaho akaugombeka uda mtini, “Wesekuvyaa vituhu matunda misi yose!” Aho uwo mtini ukanyaa.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Wahina wakwe wekuonaho mbui iyo wakahondomaa, wakamuuza, “Iwa viivihi mti unu wa mtini unyaa kinyio?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Nawamba kwei, inga mkazumiiya na mkesekuwa na matumatu, mwadaha khio du kugosoa ivyo kwa yada yekugosokanayo kwa unu mtini, iya ata mkawamba muima unu halawe uketambike mwe mazimshindo, inda igosoke ivyo. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Na mkazumiiya, dodose mwendado muombeze kwa kuvika, mwenda mwekhigwe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auzwa mbui ya udaho wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu ekwengiaho, he Nyumba ya Muungu wagookezi wa waviki na wadaa wa wantu wakamwezea ekuwaho akahinya na kugombeka, “Wagosoa mbui izi kwa udaho wani, nae ni ndai mwe kukwekha udaho unu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Na miye nendaniwauze mbui mwenga, mkanitambaisa, na miye nendaniwambe nagosoa mbui izi kwa udaho wani. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Ubatiizo wa Yohana, ulawa kuhi? Ulawa kwa Muungu hambu ulawa kwa wantu?” Wakavoka kuuzana wowo kwa wowo, “Tikamba ulawa kwa Muungu, endaatiuze, mbona khamwekumzumiiya?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Iya tikamba, “Ulawa kwa wantu, taogoha zumwezumwe da wantu kwaviya wose wammanya Yohana Mbatiiza kuwa ni muoni wa Muungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Kwaiyo wakamtambaisa, “Swie khatimanya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Nae Yesu akawamba, “Wala na miye khina niwambie ni kwa udaho wani natenda mbui izi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa wana waidi wa kigosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Nywie mwamamaakhanya viivihi? Mntu yumwe nee ana wana waidi wakigosi. Akamwamba yuda wa bosi, ‘Mwanangu, ivyeo hita kwe mnda wa mizabibu ukaime.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Yuda mwana akamtambaisa, ‘Miye khina niite,’ bada ya mda akamamakhanya na akaita. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Nee yuda tate akambasa mwanawe mtuhu akamwamba viyaviya. Yee akatambaisa, ‘Nenda niite Tate,’ iya khekuita. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Gatigati ya awo wana waidi ni yuhi mwe kugosoa kida ekukundacho Tati yao?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Wakamtambaisa, “Ni yuda wa bosi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Yesu akawamba, “Watoza ushuu na wakiyanga wao wendawaongoe kwengia mwe Useuta wa Muungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Kwaviya Yohana Mbatiiza keza kwenu na kuwaonyesha sia yedi, iya khamwekumzumiiya, akini watoza ushuu na wakiyanga wamzumiia. Nywie hata mwe kuonaho ayo, khamwekuhituka na khamwekuzumiiya.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misimo waimi mwe mnda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu akamba, “Tegeezani msimo mtuhu. Nee kuwa na mntu yumwe mwenye mnda wa mizabibu. Akadizengea buha na akafuka tubwi mda ndani da kukamwiiya divai, na akazenga mnaa. Naho akawekha waimi uwo mnda, na akatamba na kuita si ya hae.” <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Kisingi cha ubosi chekubuaho, akawaagiiya wandima wakwe kwa wada waimi wakadoe hantu ha ubosi wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Wada waimi wakawagwiiya awo wandima, yumwe wakamtoa na yumwe wakamkoma na mtuhu wakamtoa maiwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Uyo mntu akawaagiiya wandima watuhu, wangi na wangi kusima wada wa ntambo ya bosi. Wada waimi wakawagosweeya ya viyaviya inga wezwao wa bosi. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Kisikiizi akamwagiiya mwanawe kwao, uku amamaakhanya, na kugombeka, “Wendawamtunye mwanangu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Iya wada waimi wekumwonaho ni mwanawe wakegombekea wowo kwa wowo, “Uyu nee mpazi na timkome na upazi wakwe tiudoe swie!” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ahoaho wakamgwiiya na kumlavya chongoi ya uda mnda wa mizabibu na kumkoma.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yesu akawauza, “Yuda mwenye mnda, endahoeze andaawatende mbwai wada waimi?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Wowo wakamtambaisa, “Haika, endaawakome na uda mnda enda awekhe waimi watuhu, wendao wamwekhe hantu ha ubosi kwa kisingi chakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu akawamba, “Khamzati kusoma mwe Maandiko yagombekavyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Iwe wekuemeado wazengi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Isasa diwa iwe kuu da khandakhanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Zumbe nee mwe kugosoa mbui inu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Nayo ni kiozo muno umu mwetu!’<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Nawagombeka,” “Useuta wa Muungu wendauusigwe aha henu na kwekhigwa wantu wa si ntuhu wada wagosoao yada yamtamizayo Muungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Yesu akaendeea kugombeka, “Yee endaeagwe mwe iwe idi endaabondeke bondeke ntii, iya yuda dendaedimgwiiye endaahondeke muno.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Wagookezi wa waviki wakuu na Mafalisayo wekutegeezaho misimo iyo wakamanya nee akawagombekea wowo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Wakoondeza sia ya kumgwiiya, iya wakaogoha zumwezumwe da wantu kwaviya wantu nee wamkauwa Yesu kuwa ni muoni.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Msimo wa ndoza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu akagombeka nao vituhu wada wantu kwa misimo. <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Useuta wa uwanga kwa Muungu waigana na zumbe yumwe mwekumgosoeya mwanawe ntafuno ya ndoza. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Akawaagiiya wandima na kuwetanga wekugonekwao weze kwe ndoza, iya wekugonekwao khawakukunda kweza. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Naho akawaagiiya wandima vituhu wawambe wada wekugonekwao, ‘Isasa ntafuno iikwa kae khande. Na nyama za njeku na wesao kudahaa vitana kia kintu kiikwa kae!’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Iya wowo khawekupatiiza, wakahauka, yumwe kaita tanga kwakwe na mtuhu kwe biashaa zakwe, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />na watuhu wakawagwiiya wakawatoa na kuwakoma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Yuda Seuta akakimwa, akawaagiiya maasikai wakwe wakawadagamize wada wakomaji na kuubananga mzi wao kwa moto. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Aho akawamba wandima wakwe, ‘Ntafuno ya ndoza itayali, iya wekugonekwao wakaemea kweza. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Hitani mwe baabaa na wowose wendao muwabwiiye wetangani weze kwe ndoza,’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />wada wandima wakalawa na kuita mwe baabaa, wakawaika hamwe wantu wose, wafyaimi na wedi. Nyumba ya ndoza ikamema wageni.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Seuta ekwengiaho kuwakauwa wageni akamwona mntu yumwe ambae khekuvaa gwanda da ndoza. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Seuta akamuuza, ‘Mmbuya, kwengia viivihi uku khuna gwanda da ndoza?’ Yuda mntu khekuwa na dakugombeka. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Ahoaho Seuta akawamba wandima, ‘Mzengetezeni sigi za mwe miundi na mwe mikono mkamwase chongoi kwe kiza, uko endaaiye na kuuma meno.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yesu akabindiizia kwa kugombeka, “Wantu wekwetangwao ni wangi, iya wekusagulwao niwacheche.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auzwa mbui kuiha ushuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:26">Luka 20:26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Nee Mafalisayo wakahauka na kuita sia ya kuteganya wendavyo wamgwiye Yesu kwa ntamwiizi zakwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Aho wakawaagiiya wahina wao hamwe na wahina wa kizumwezumwe cha Mahelode. Wakamuuza, “Mhinyi, tamanya wee ni mntu yedi na wahinya sia ya Muungu ya wantu kugosoa yekuwayo yedi, khumwogoha mntu yoyose kwamana ya ukuu wakwe na ukuu wakwe kwako khio kintu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Haya tambie wee waona viivihi? Ni vyedi kumuiha ushuu kwa seuta mkuu wa Lumi hambu tisekumuiha?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Yesu akamanya nteganyi zao za ufyaimi akawagombeka, “Nywie ni wahokho, kwambwai mwanigeeza kwa kunihega? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Nionyeshani iyo sensi iihayo ushuu.” Nawo wakamwekha sensi mwenga. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Ahoaho, Yesu akamuuza, “Cheni na magondo aya ni ya ndai?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Wakatambaisa, “Ni seuta mkuu wa lumi.” Aho Yesu akawamba, “Ya seuta mkuu wa lumi mwekheni seuta mkuu wa lumi na ya Muungu mwekheni Muungu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Wekusikiavyo ivyo nee wahondomaa, wakambada wakaita.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auzwa mbui ya uyuyuko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Msi uwouwo wamwe wa Masadukayo wagombekao wekufao khawayuyuka vituhu wakamtimia Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Na kumwamba, “Mhinyi, Musa kagombeka mntu inga akategua na akauya na nyuma na khekubada mwana, yakundigwa nduguye amtegue uyo mvyee mwekufiiwa ni mgosi, ili ampatie wana. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Hanu hetu nee kuwa na wandugu mfungate. Wabosi kategua nee auya na nyuma na khekujaiwa mwana, akadoigwa ni nduguye uyo mvyee mwekufiiwa ni mgosi. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Vikagosoka ivyoivyo kwa ndugu wakaidi na wantatu, adi wose mfungate. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Bada ya ndugu awo wose kuuya na nyuma na yuda mvyee nae akauya na nyuma. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Wendaho ubue uwo msi wa uyuyuko wendaho wayuyuke mvyee uyo endaawe ni mkaza ndai wamwe wa wada wandugu mfungate? Kwaviya wose mfungate nee wamtegua.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Nywie mwaga kwaajii khammanya Maandiko ya Muungu wala udaho wa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Kisingi wantu wendaho wayuyuke khawana wategulwe wala kutegua, iya wendawawe inga wandima wa uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Iya kwa ida mbui ya wantu kuyuyuka tambe khamzati kusoma yada ekuwagombekayo Muungu? <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Miye ni Muungu wa Iblahimu na Muungu wa Isaka na Muungu wa Yakobo!’ Yee khie Muungu wa wekuuyao na nyuma, iya ni Muungu waugima.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Yada mazumwezumwe ya wantu yekutegeezaho mahinyo yakwe wakahondomazwa muno.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amli kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maliko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Mafalisayo wekusikiaho kuwa Yesu kawatwiiza Masadukayo, na wakakintana hamwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Yumwe wa Mafalisayo ambae amanya miko, akamuuza Yesu kwa kumgeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Mhinyi mwe miko ni amli ihi yekuwayo khuu?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “ ‘Mkundise Zumbe Muungu yako kwa moyo wako wose na muye wako wose na kwa akii zako zose.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Inu nee amli khuu na ya bosi. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Yakaidi yaigana na inu, ‘Mkundise mntu yoyose inga wekundisavyo wee mwenye.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Miko yose ya Musa na mahinyizo ya Waoni zizengwa na amli izi mbii.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbui ya Klistu mwohozi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Kisingi Mafalisayo wekukintanaho hamwe, Yesu akawauza. <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Nywie mwaona viivihi kuusu klistu mwohozi? Yee ni mwana wa ndai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Wakamtambaisa, “Yee ni mwana ya Daudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu akawauza, “Yadahika viivihi Daudi akaongweewa na Muye wa Muungu amwetange Klistu ni ‘Zumbe?’ Kwaviya kagombeka,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Zumbe kamwamba Zumbe yangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Ekaa he mkono wangu wa kuume</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Adi nendaho niwavote wamasa wako.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Akawa Daudi amwetanga Klistu ‘Zumbe’, yadahika viivihi Daudi kuwa mwanawe?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Khahana mntu yoyose mwekudaha kumtambaisa Yesu mbui iyo, na kuvokea msi uwo khahana mwekudaha kugeeza kumuuza vituhu dodose.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awaakia wahinyi wa Miko na Mafalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maliko 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luka 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Naho Yesu akawamba wada wantu wangi na wangi wekuwao aho, hamwe na wahina, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Wahinyi wa Miko na Mafalisayo nee wekwekhigwao udaho wakusosoa miko ya Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Ivyo tozani na mtongee dodose wendado wawagombekee. Iya mwesekutongea yada wayagosoayo, kwaviya wowo khawayatongea yada wayahinyayo. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Wadoa maafuushi yazamayo na kuwabadika wantu mwe mawega, akini wowo wenye khawakunda kuidon'ta hata kwa chaa wadahe kuyenua. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Wao wagosoacho mbui zao zose ili kwakweonyesha he meso ya wantu. Kwaviya wavaa kwenye vyeni vyao na mwe mikono yao ntii khuu za babu ambavyo viandikwa miko ya Musa, na kuomeea mafundo mwe magwanda yao. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Wakunda kwekaa phasi za kutunywa mwe ntafuno na vigoda vya kutunywa mwe Nyumba za kukintania Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Wakunda kuuguswa kwa kutunywa gwiiyo na nakwetangwa na wantu. ‘Mhinyi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Iya nywie wantu wasekuwetanga ‘Mhinyi.’ Kwaviya mhinyi yenu ni yumwedu, na nywie wose ni ndugu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Nahodu mwesekumwetanga mntu yoyose ‘Tate’ hanu mwe inusi kwaviya Tate yenu ni yumwedu, mweuko uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Naho mwesekwetangwa ‘Wagookezi,’ Kwaviya mgookezi yenu ni yumwedu nee Klistu. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Na mntu yoyose ambae akunda kuwa mgookezi, akundigwa awe awagosoeya ndima wenziwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Na mntu yoyose egosoaye kuwa mkuu Muungu enda amtende mdodo na yoyose etendae mdodo Muungu enda amtende mkuu.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awawakia wahokho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maliko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Mmbwii yenu, wahinyi wa miko na Mafalisayo mwekuwao wahokho! Uvi muuvugaa wa Useuta wa Muungu hemeso ya wantu. Nywie wenye khamwengia umo, naho khamuwabada watuhu wakundao kwengia wengie. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Mmbwii yenu wahinyi wa miko na Mafalisayo nywie wahokho! Mwada khande mwe nyumba za wavyee wekufiwao ni wagosi, nywie mwetenda kuwa ni wedi mwavika kisingi kileacho. Kwaajii iyo mwenda mwekhigwe sugusa khai.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Mmbwii yenu, wahinyi wa miko na Mafalisayo, wahokho! Mwatamba mwe mazimshindo na mwesanga khavu ili mmuohoe mntu esae kuwa Myahudi awe Myahudi mkabinda awatongea nywie, iya mkabinda kumpata mwamgosoa awe mntu akundigwae kuita mwe si ya moto wesao kukomeka inga nywie wenye.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Mmbwii yenu, wagookezi matuntu! Nywie mwahinya, ‘mntu akaaha kwa Nyumba ya Muungu khio kintu, iya akaaha kwa zahabu yekuwayo mwe Nyumba ya Muungu kuaha kwakwe kwenda kumtoze.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Nywie matuntu wahezi! Kihi ambacho ni cha mana muno, ni zahabu hambu Nyumba ya Muungu yekugosoayo iyo zahabu iwe ya Muungu! <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Naho mwahinya mntu akaaha kwa ingo da kulaviya malavyo khio kintu, iya akaaha kwa funge ikuikwayo uwanga ya ingo, kuaha kwakwe uko kwamtoza. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Nywie matuntu kweikwei! Ni kihi chekuwacho kikuu muno. Ni funge hambu ingo ambado dagosoa iyo funge iwe ya Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Kwaiyo mntu aahae kwa ingo da kulaviya malavyo, kuaha kwa ido ingo na vintu vyose vyekuwavyo uwanga yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Na aahae kwa Nyumba ya Muungu, kaaha kwa iyo Nyumba ya Muungu na yuda ekaae ndani yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Na aahae kwa uwanga kwa uwanga kwa Muungu, aaha kwa kigoda cha kiseuta cha Muungu na kwa uyo ekaae uwanga yakwe.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Mmbwii yao, wahinyi wa miko na Mafalisayo, wahokho! Mwawatoza wantu zaka ya mani ya halufu ntana, na binzali, na bwache, na uku mwabada mbui za miagiiyo inga viya haki na mbazi na uzumizi. Aya nee asa mkundigwayo kuyagosoa na mwesekujaa yada matuhu. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Wagookezi matuntu! Mwalavya nisi mwe vyakudomeea, akini mwakhia ngamia!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Mmbwii yenu Wahinyi wa Miko na Mafalisayo wahokho! Mwasunta kikombe na kalai kwa chongoi, iya ndani mwabada kumema vintu mwe kupatavyo kwa kuwahoka wantu na uchoyo. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Nywie Mafalisayo matuntu! Vokani kusunta kikombe ndani, na chongoi chendakiwe kisuntika.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Mmbwii yao wahinyi wa miko na Mafalisayo nyie wahokho! Mwaigana na mambia yekusiswayo nchokaa ambayo kwa chongoi yakaulwa kuwa ni matana, akini umo ndani yamema mavuha ya vimba na kia namna ya usama. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Viyaviya kwa chongoi nywie mwaonekana kuwa ni wantu wedi, akini kwa ndani mmema uhokho na kia namna ya ufyaimi.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awamba mafalisayo sugusa yao yezayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Mmbwii yenu wahinyi wa miko na Mafalisayo, wahokho. Mwayazengea mambia ya waoni na mwayazengea na kuhamba mbia za wantu wedi, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />nywie mwagombeka, inga nee tiwaaho kisingi cha wadaa wetu nee khatokutongeana nao mwe ukomaji wa waoni!” <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ivyo mwesemea wenye kuwa nywie ni uvyaigwa wa wantu wekukomao waoni <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Aya iiganizeni ndima ida wadaa wenu wekuivokayo. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Enywi uvyazi wa mdudu mwenye sumu! Mwendamdahe viivihi kuhepa sugusa ya si ya moto wesao kukomeka misi yose kwesiho kiisikizi? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Nee mana miye nawegaiiya nyie waoni, wantu wenye akii na wahinyi, mwenda muwakome na kuwagong'ondea he mhamba na wamwe wao, na watuhu mwendamuwatoe ngoda mwe nyumba za kukintania Wayahudi na kuwaguusa kwa kia mzi. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ivyo lawama yose inda iwapate kwaajii ya phome yose ya wantu wedi wa Muungu yekwetiwayo uwanga ya inusi, kuvokea phome ya Abeli ambae khekuwa na hatia hadi ida ya Zakalia, mwana wa Balakia ambae mumkoma he Nyumba ya Muungu gatigati ya hantu hang'azi ha ingo. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nawamba kwei, wantu wa kivyazi iki chendachekhigwe sugusa kwaajii ya mbui izi.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekuwakundisavyo wantu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Nywie wantu wa Yelusalemu! Nywie wantu wa Yelusalemu! Uwakomae waoni wa Muungu na kuwatambikia maiwe wada wose wekuagiiwao aha hako. Maa nyingahi khigeeza kuwaika hamwe wana wako kwangu, inga via nguku awatamiiavyo wanawe asi ya mawawa yakwe, akini khamwekukunda. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Kauwa Muungu endaaibade Nyumba yenu yenda ibomolwe na kubadwa ukiwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Nakwamba, khuna unikauwe vituhu hadi kisingi wendaho ugombeke, ‘Ajaiwe uyo ezae kwa zina da Zumbe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atamwiiya kubanangwa kwa Nyumba ya Muungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliko 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu akalawa he Nyumba ya Muungu, wahina wakwe wakamtimia na kumwonyesha mazengo ya Nyumba ya Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yesu akawamba, “Ni sawa, mwadaha kuyakauwa aya yose! Kwei nawamba, khahana hata iwe dimwe dendado disigae uwanga ya iwe tuhu, kia iwe dendadibomolwe.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suuba na usuumizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu ekuwaho kekaa he muima wa Mizaituni, wahina wakwe wakamtimia Yesu ili wawe ikedu, wakamuuza, “Tambie, mbui izi zendazilawiiye ini, na ni ntangio ihi ya kweza kwako na ntangio ya kisikiizi cha inusi ni mbwai.”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Kuwani meso mntu asekuwatiiya. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kwaviya wangi wendaweze na wendawatumiye zina dangu na kugombeka, ‘Miye nee Klistu, nao wenda wawatiiye wangi.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Mwenda mtegeeze mbui za khondo na ufukufuku wa khondo kauweni mwesekuogoha, kwaviya aya yakundigwa yalawiiye, iya kia kisikiizi chenye khakizati. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Wantu wa si mwenga wenda watoane khondo na wantu wa si ntuhu, wantu wa useuta umwe wenda watoane khondo na wantu wa useuta mtuhu. Kwendakuwe na saa na mizingizo mwe hantu mbaimbai mwe inusi. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Yose ayo ni inga usungu wa bosi wa kwefungua mwana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Naho mwenda muemewe na wantu na kuwasuumiza na kukomwa. Wantu wa Si zose wenda wawakime kwaajii kunizumiia miye. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Naho wangi wenda wabade kuzumiia kwao na wendawahitukane na khawana wakundisane katu. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Wendawalawiiye waoni wangi wa uhokho, nao wenda wawatiiye wantu wangi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Naho ukundiso wa wantu wangi wenda uhungue, kwaajii mavigaviga yenda yawe yamema. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Na yoyose endaeagooke mwe untintimavu adi kisikiizi, uyo nee endaeaoholwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Mbui Yedi ya useuta wa Muungu inda ibiikiwe mwe inusi yose, ili wantu wose waimanye nee kisikiizi chendahocheze.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suuba khuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maliko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Ivyo mwendaho muone mbui ya kutisa na dietado ubanasi, digooka he Nyumba ya Muungu inga ekugombekavyo muoni Danieli, ivyo kia asomaye na amanye mbui iyo.” <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Aho, wada wekaao Uyahudi waguukie he miima. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Yoyose mwe uwanga ya taa da nyumba yakwe asekuseeya kudoa chochose kulawa mwe nyumba yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Ekuwae tanga asekuuya kaya kudoa gwanda dakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Mmbwii yao wakina mmaa wekwenuao maifu na waokhesao misi iyo! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ombezani Muungu kuguuka kwenu kusekuwa kisingi cha khusi hambu Msi wa Kuhumuiza. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kwaviya kisingi icho chendakiwe na suuba khuu ambayo khaizati kulawiia kuvokea aho bosi wa inusi adi ivyeo, wala khakina kilawiiye vituhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Iya Muungu kahunguza misi izo, inga khekugosoa ivyo khahana mntu ambae nee kaoholwa, na Muungu kazihunguza kwaajii ya wantu wakwe ekuwasaguwao.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Kisingi icho mntu yoyose akawamba, ‘Klistu, yuhanu!’ Hambu ‘Yuhada,’ msekuzumiiya.” <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kwaviya wendawalawiiye wantu wetangao Klistu akini khio, naho wendawalawiiye waoni wa uhokho. Wendawagosoe ntangio na vihii vikuu vya kudaha kuwaza, vikadahika hata wekusagulwao ni Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Kauwani! Khibindiiza kuwahaza kae kabla mbui izo khazizati kulawiia.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Kwaiyo, mntu yoyose akawamba, ‘Klistu yuuko he nyika, msekuita.’ Hambu wakagombeka, ‘Klistu yuuko gati, msekuzumiiya.’ <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Kwaviya inga umbauwa umuikavyo kulawa awiyo da zua adi engiiyo da zua, nee ivyo vyendavyoviwe kweza kwakwe Mwana wa Mntu.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />“Hada weiho mzoga, neaho wakintanaho tai.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kweza kwakwe Mwana wa Mntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Maa misi iyo za suuba zendaho zemboke, Muungu endaadihitue zuwa kuwa kiza na mweenge nayo khaina ilavye mng'ao na ntoondo zendazigwe kulawa uwanga, viyaviya endaazisingise nguvu za uwanga. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Aho wenda uoneke ntangio ya Mwana wa Mntu uwanga kwa Muungu na wantu wose mwe inusi wenda watoe bwaimbo, wenda wamwone Mwana wa Mntu akeza uwanga ya maangwi ya uwanga kwa Muungu kwa udaho na ukuu mwingi. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Nae endaawaagiiye wandima wa uwanga kwa Muungu uku watoa gunda divumado muno, nao wendawawaike hamwe wekusagulwao ni Muungu kulawa phande zose nne za inusi, kulawa kisikizi iki cha inusi adi kisikizi kituhu cha inusu.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwehinya kulawa kwa mti wetangwao mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Mwehinye kulawa kwa mti wa mkuyu, muonaho matambi yakwe yamema mani, mwamanya kisingi cha fua kibua. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Ivyoivyo, mwonaho mbui izo zikagosoka mmanye kuwa Seuta yuhehi muno. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Nawamba kwei, wantu wa kivyazi iki khauna wemboke kabla ya mbui izo khazizati kulawiiya. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Uwanga kwa Muungu na inusi zendazemboke, iya mbui zangu khazina zemboke katu.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khahana amanyae msi wala saa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maliko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:32-37">Luka 17:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Kwa mbui ya msi uda na saa ida khahana amanyae, ata wandima wa uwanga kwa Muungu wala Mwana, iya Tate ikedu nee amanyae msi uwo. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Inga yekuwavyo kisingi cha Nuhu, nee vyendavyoviwe kweza kwakwe Mwana wa Mntu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kwaviya kisingi icho, kabla ya mazi mangi kuigubika inusi, wantu neewawa wakada na kudomea, wakategua na kutegulwa, hadi Nuhu ekwengiaho mwe ida Safina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Khawokumanya kuna mbwai hadi yada mazi mangi yekulawiiyaho, kuwakumba wose. Nee vendavyoviwe kisingi Mwana wa Mntu endahoeze. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Kisingi icho wantu waidi wendawawe tanga yumwe endaadoigwe na mtuhu endaabadwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Wavyee waidi wendawawe wakabunduga khande, yumwe endaadoigwe na mtuhu endaabadwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Ekauweni, kwaviya khammanya msi endahoeze Zumbe yenu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Iya mmanye mbui inu, inga mwenye nyumba ati nee kamanya msi mbavi endahoabue, nee akacheeza, wala khekuwa aibadie nyumba yakwe itulwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Viyaviya nanywi mwekae meso, kwaviya Mwana wa Mntu endaeze saa mwesayokuikauwiya.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndima mkwei na mwesekuwa mkwei</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Nindai mndima mkwei na mwenye akii, ambae zumbe yakwe endaamwiike agookee weziwe na awekhe khande kwa kisingi chakwe? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Yendaiwe vyedi mndima uyo ambae zumbe yakwe endahoeze endaambwiiye agosoa ivyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Nawamba kwei, endaamwiike mndima uyo agookee vintu vyakwe vyose. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Inga mndima ni mfyaimi akegombekea mwe moyo, ‘Zumbe yangu endaacheewe kuuya,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />nae akavoka kuwatoa wandima weziwe, na kuvoka kuda na kudomea hamwe na wakozi, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />zumbe yakwe mndima uyo endaeze msi ambao mndima khamkauwiiya na saa ida ambayo khaimanya. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Endaamsuumize vifyaimi na kumwiika hamwe na wahokho. Uko kwendakuwe na ndio na kuuma meno kwa usungu.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Msimo wa wandee kumi dimwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Useuta wa Muungu wendauigane na wandee kumi dimwe wekudoao taa zao, na wakaita kumhokea zumbe wa ndoza.” <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Washano nee niwahezi na washano wawa wenye akii. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Wada wahezi wadoa taa zao, iya khawekudoa mavuta ya kuomeea, <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Iya wada wenye akii wadoa taa zao na mavuta ya kuomeea mwe nchupa zao. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Kwaviya mteguzi kacheewa kweza, wada wandee wose wakasikha na wakagona.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Kio kikuu kukawa na vuzo, ‘Homgwiiyo, homgwiiyo! Mteguzi eza, hitani mkamhokee.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Aho wada wandee wose wakenuka wakaziika vitana taa zao. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Wada wahezi wakawamba wada wenye akii, ‘Tipangieni mavuta kwaviya taa zetu zafa.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Akini wada wenye akii wakawamba, ‘Khayanayatitoshe nywie na swiswi! Ni ebae mwiite kwa watagao mavuta mkague wenye!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Aho wada wandee wahezi, wakaita kugua mavuta. Uku nyuma mteguzi akabua, na wada wekuwao watayali wakengia hamwe nae mwe nyumba ya wiya, na uvi ukavugalwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Yekwembokaho ayo wada wandee watuhu wakeza, na kwetanga. ‘Zumbe, Zumbe, tivuguiye uvi!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Akini yee akawatambaisa, ‘Nawamba kwei,’ khiwamanya nywie.”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Ahoaho Yesu akawamba, “Ekauweni, kwaviya khammanya msi wala saa.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa wandima watatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Naho Useuta wa Muungu inga mntu yumwe mwe kukunda kutamba, akawetanga wandima wakwe, akawekha vintu vyakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Akamwekha kadii ya udaho wa kia yumwe, yumwe vifuko vya hea vishano na mtuhu vifuko vya hea viidi na mtuhu kifuko cha hea kimwe, na ahoaho akatamba. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Yuda mwe kwekhigwa vifuko vya hea vishano akazigosoeya biashaa zikavyaa vifuko vya hea vishano ntuhu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Viavia yuda mwe kwekhigwa vifuko vya hea viidi nazo zikavyaa vifuko vya hea vituhu. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Iya yuda mwe kwekhigwa kifuko cha hea kimwe, yee akaita akafuka tubwi na kuifukia kia kifuko cha hea ya zumbe yakwe.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Yekwembokaho kisingi kilehacho, yuda zumbe wa wada wandima akauya, na kugosoa ntaazia nao. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Yuda mndima mwe kwekhigwa vifuko vishano vya hea akeza uku kaeta vifuko vishano vya hea zekuongezekazo. Akagombeka. ‘Zumbe kunekha vifuko vishano vya hea, kauwa kiongeza mituhu mishano.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Zumbe wakwe akamwamba, ‘Vyedi mndima yedi, nee kuwa yedi kwa vintu vicheche, ninda nikuike uwe mgookezi kwa vintu vingi. Soo ushiiki nyemi ya zumbe yako!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Yuda mwekwekhigwa vifuko viidi vya hea mbii nae akeza. Akagombeka, ‘Zumbe kunekha vifuko viidi vya heya mbii. Kauwa kieta vifuko vituhu viidi.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Zumbe yakwe akamtambaisa, ‘Kutenda vyedi muno mndima yedi na kuwa mzumiiwa mwe mbui ndodo, nendanikuike kuwa yedi kwa vintu vingi. Soo ushiiki mwe nyemi ya zumbe yako!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Naho yuda mndima mwekwekhigwa kifuko kimwe cha heya akeza na kugombeka, ‘Zumbe, namanya kuwa wee ni mntu utogae, wabonda kwesiho kuhanda na kukisanya kwesiho kwetiya mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Khikuogoha kwaza kifiko chako cha hea, na khiifisa kifuko kimwe cha heya yako mwe sanga. Doa kifuko kimwe cha heya yako.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Zumbe yakwe akamwamba, ‘Wee ni mndima mfyaimi na mbwa! Kumanya kuwa, miye nabonda hantu ambaho nchekuhanda, nadoa hantu ambaho nchekwetiya mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Kukundingwa kuika kifuko cha hea kwa walavyao nyongeza, na miye mwe kifuko changu nee khipata nyongeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Haya mhokeni icho kifuko cha hea mkamwekhe yuda mwenye vifuko kumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kwaviya mwena endaekhigwe na ngeeko. Na yuda mwesena hata kia enacho endaahokwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Mtambikeni uyu mndima mfyaimi chongoi mwe kiza! Uko kundakuwe na ndio na kuuma meno kwa usungu.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuamwiiwa kwa kisikiizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Mwana wa Mntu endahoeze na ukuu wakwe na wandima wa Muungu wakawa hamwe nae, aho endaekae mwe kigoda chakwe cha Useuta na ukuu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Wantu wa si zose wendawakintane hemeso yakwe, nae enda awaike wantu inga via mwiisi awaikavyo ngoto hantu hakwe na mbuzi hantu hakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Aho endaawaiike ngoto phande ya kuume na mbuzi phande ya kumoso. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Naho Seuta endaawambe wada wa phande ya kuume, ‘Sooni nywie mwekujaiwao na Tate yangu, hokeani Useuta mwekuikiwao kae kuvokea kugosolwa kwa inusi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kwaviya nekhiwa na saa, mkanekha khande, na nekhiwa na khiu mkanidomeza na nekhiwa mgeni mkanihokea, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />nekhiwa mwazi mkanivika magwanda na nekhiwa mtamu mkeza kunikauwa na nekhiwa mwe kifungoni mkeza kunivuiiya.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Aho awo wantu wedi wenda wamtambaise na kumwamba, ‘Zumbe ni ini, tekukuonaho una saa tikakwekha khande hambu ukawa na khiu tikakudomeza mazi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ni ini tekukuonaho umgeni na swie tikakuhokea na tekukuonaho umwazi tikakuvika magwanda? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Na ni ini tikuona ukawa mtamu tikeza kukukauwa hambu wekuwaho mwe kifungo tikeza kukuvuiiya.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Nae Seuta endaawatambaise, ‘Kwei nawamba, chochose mwekuwagosweado wamwe wa awa wandugu zangu mnigosweeya miye!’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Ahoaho endaawambe wada wekuwao phande yakwe ya kumoso, haukeni aha hangu, nywie mwe kubadiwao lazi, hitani mwe moto wa misi zose kwesaho kukomeka na wekuikwao kae kwaajii ya ibiisi na wandima wakwe! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Kwaviya nekhiwa na saa khamwekunekha khande na nekhiwa na khiu khamwekunidomeza mazi; <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Nekhiwa mgeni nywie khamwekunihokea, na nekhiwa mwazi khamwekunivika magwanda na nekhiwa mtamu khamwekweza kunikauwa, na nekhiwa mwe khiwa mwe kifungo khamwekweza kunivuiiya.” <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Wowo wenda wamtambaise, “Zumbe, ni ini, tekukuonaho una saa na khiu, hambu ukawa mgeni na umwazi, na ukawa mtamu, na ukawa mwe kifungo, khatikweza kukuambiza?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Nae endaawatambaise, “Nawamba kwei kiya mwekuemeavyo kumwambiiza yumwe wa wadodo awa mwemea kuniambiiza miye.” <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />“Awa wendawaite kwe usuumizi wa misi zose zesazo kuwa na kisiikizi, na wada wantu wedi wenda waite kwe ugima wa misi zose zesazo kuwa na kisiikizi.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Nteganyi za kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu ekubindaho kuwahinya ayo yose, akawamba wahina wakwe, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Mwamanya kuwa bada ya misi miidi indaiwe ni sikukhuu ya Pasaka, na Mwana wa Mntu endaalavigwe ili agong'ondewe mwe mhamba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Naho wagookezi wa waviki wakakintana hamwe kwe ukumbi wa Mviki Mkuu zina dake Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Wakagosoa nteganyi wendavyo wamgwiiye kwa sii kwa unyanyi na kumkoma. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Iya wakamba, “Isekuwa kisingi cha sikukhuu ama khivyo kunda kulawiiye khumbizi kwa wantu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etiiwa mavuta uko Besania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu ekuwaho Besania kaya kwa Simoni, mwekuwa na utamu wa nyoka. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Mvyee yumwe mwekuwa na nchupa ya iwe yetangwayo alibasta yenye mavuta yanukhiayo vitana ya yombe khuu, akamtimia hada Yesu ekwekaaho ada khande, na akamwetiiya ayo mavuta mwe mtwi. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Wahina wakwe wekuonaho ayo wakakimwa na kugombeka, “Kwambwai taza hea ivi! <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Mavuta aya nee yatagwa kwa yombe khuu, na hea izo wekhigwe wakiwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu akamanya mamakhanyi zao, akawamba, “Kwambwai mwampisha uyu mvyee? Yee kanigosoeya mbui yedi. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Wakiwa mnao misi yose, iya miye khamna muwe nami misi yose. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Mvyee uyu kanitiiya mavuta ili niwe tayali kwa maziko yangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Nawambeni kwei, hohose mweinusi ambaho Mbui Yedi yendaibiikiwe, kintu iki ekugosoacho mvyee uyu chendakitamwiiwe kwa khumbuso yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda Isikaliote amhituka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Naho Yuda Isikaliote, yumwe wa wada wahina kumi dimwe na waidi, akaita kwa wagookezi wa waviki, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />akawamba, “Mwendamnekhe mbwahi nendahonimhituke Yesu kwenu?” Wakamtaazia ntii makumi matatu ya madini ya feza. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kuvokea kisingi icho Yuda Isikaliote akaondeza phasi ya kumhituka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ada khande ya Pasaka hamwe na wahina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-23">Luka 22:7-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Msi wa bosi ya sikukhuu ya mabumunda yesayo kugewa hamila, wahina wakaita kwa Yesu na kumuuza, “Wakunda tikuikie kuhi khande ya Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yee akawatambaisa, “Hitani mwe mzi kwa mntu yumwe, na mmwambe, ‘Mhinyi amba kisingi changu kibua, mwe nyumba yako nakunda niide khande ya Pasaka hamwe na wahina wangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Wahina wakatenda inga Yesu ekuwaagiiavyo, wakaandaa khande ya Pasaka. <verse eid="MAT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Yekubuaho guoni, akekaa asi hamwe na wahina wakwe kumi dimwe na waidi. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Wekuwaho wakada, Yesu akawamba, “Nawambeni kwei, yumwe yenu endaanihituke.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Wahina wakaungumia muno, wakavoka kuuza yumweyumwe, “Ni miye Zumbe?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Agintae bumunda hamwe na miye mwe wiga nee endae anihituke. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana wa Mntu aita zakwe inga Maandiko yagombekavyo, iya mmbwii yakwe mntu yuda amhitukae Mwana wa Mntu! Neeiwa ebae kwa mntu uyo inga khekuvyaigwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda Isikaliote ambae nee mwe kumhituka akamuuza, “Mhinyi! Ivi ni miye?” Yesu akamtambaisa, “Eehe weye mwenye kugombeka”.<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khande ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Wekuwaho wakada, Yesu akadoa bumunda akamtogoa Muungu, akadibendua akawekha wahina wakwe akamba, “Doani mde unu nee mwii wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Akakidoa kikombe cha divai akamtogoa Muungu akawekha akamba, domeani wose, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />“Inu nee phome yangu iyonyeshayo Agane dangu ni dakwei, phome yetiwayo kwaajii ya wantu wangi kwa kuwausia mavigaviga. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nawamba, khina nidomee vituhu divai ya mzabibu adi msi uda nendaho nidomee mphya hamwe na nywinywi mwe Useuta wa Tate yangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Wekubindaho kutoa wiya, wakahauka wakaita mwe muima wa mizeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amba pwii Petulo endavyoamuemee</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Aho Yesu akagombeka, “Kio cha ivyeo nywie wose mwendamniguuke kwaviya Maandiko yagombeka, ‘Muungu endaamtoe mwiisi na tintimo da ngoto dendadiangadike.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Iya bada ya miye kuyuyuka nendaniwaongwee uko Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petulo akamwamba Yesu, “Wose wakakubada miye katu khinanikubade.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu akamwamba Petulo, “Kwei nakwamba, kio iki zogoo khadizati kukema wendauniemee maa ntatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Petulo akamwamba, “Hata nikakudigwa niuye na nyuma hamwe nawe khinanikubade katu.” Wada wahina watuhu wose wakatamwiiya viyaviya.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avika uko Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Yesu akaita hamwe na wahina wakwe adi hantu ekwetangwaho Getisemani akawamba, “Ekaeni hanu, miye naita kuvika.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Akamdoa Petulo hamwe na wada wana waidi wa Zebedayo, akavoka kuwa na usungu na uku aona kiyangayanga, <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />aho akawamba, “Nina usungu muno mwe moyo ata nihehi na kuuya na nyuma, ekaeni hanu na msekugona na muwe hamwe na miye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Aho akaita mbee kidogo akagonea ifu, akavika akamba, “Tate yangu, usekutenda nengie mwe masuumizo yezayo isasa, khio inga nikundavyo miye iya inga ukundavyo wee.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Akawatimia wada wahina akawabwiia wagona, neamuuza Petulo, “Yaani khamwekudaha kucheeza hamwe na miye hata saa dimwe? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Msekugona iya vikani msekweza kwengia mwe mageezo. Kwaviya muye wakunda akini mwii unyong'onyea.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Akaita vituhu maa ya kaidi akavika, “Eee Tate yangu, ikawa khaidahika kuyembokea maasumizo haya makuu, naho ugosoe ukundavyo wee.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Akawatimia vituhu akawabwiiya wagona, kwaviya nee watozwa muno na usisiza.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Aho akawabada, akaita vituhu kuvika maa ya ntatu kwa mbui idaida. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Naho akawaitiya wada wahina, akawamba, “Mke mgonie na kuhumwiza? Kauwani, saa ibua na Mwana wa Mntu endaalavigwe kwa wantu wenye mavigaviga. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Enukani, titeni! Kauwani, eza yuda endaeanihituke.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agwiwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Ekuwaho ake kugombeka, Yuda Isikaliote yumwe wa wada wahina kumi dimwe na waidi akabua, uku katongeana na zumwezumwe kuu da wantu wenye malungu na mapaange wekuwao waagiiwa na wagookezi wa waviki na wagookezi wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yuda Isikaliote mwe kukunda kumhituka Yesu akawekha awo wantu ntangio, “Mntu uyo nendae nimuuguse kwa kumuumbatia uyo mgwiyeni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Yuda Isikaliote akamtimia Yesu hehi akamuugusa, “Mhinyi nakuugusa!” Nee amuumbatia.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu akamwamba, “Mbuyangu gosoa wekwezeado.” Aho wada wantu wakamtimia nee wamfuntia na kumgwiiya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Yumwe wa wada wekuwao hamwe na Yesu akasomoa tuni dakwe khuu, akamsenga gutwi mtumwa wa mviki mkuu. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yesu akamwamba, “Vuza tuni dako mwe kisafuo, kwaviya yoyose atumiae tuni kwa kukoma wantu, endaauye na nyuma kwa tuni. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Ivi tambe khammanya kuwa nadaha kumwombeza uwambiizi Tate yangu akanietea mazumwezumwe kumi dimwe na mbii ya wandima wakwe wa Muungu? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Iya nikagosoa ivyo Maandiko ya Muungu yendayaiganie viivihi?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Kisingi ichoicho Yesu akadigombeka ido zumwezumwe da wantu, “Ivi mweza kunigwiiya kwa mapaange na malungu inga miye nibagaa? Kia msi nekhiwa he Nyumba ya Muungu nikahinya, na khamwekunigwiiya! <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Iya aya yose yagosoka ili Maandiko wekuandikayo waoni yaiganie.” Nee wahina wose wakambada na kumguuka.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hemeso ya Mkonga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maliko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Wada wantu wekumgwiiyao Yesu wakamwegaa he nyumba ya mviki mkuu ekwetangwae Kayafa, wekukintanikaho wahinyi wa miko na wagookezi wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Petulo akamtongea kwa hae adi kwe ukumbi da mviki mkuu, akengia mwe buha da ida nyumba hamwe na wagoji adahe kukauwa mbui zendavyozilawiiye. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Wagookezi wa mkonga na waviki wakuu wakaondeza uvuhuzi wa uhokho wadahe kumkoea masa Yesu ili wamkome. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Iya khawekupata uvuhuzi wowose, etiho nee weza wavuhuzi wangi wa uhokho. Kisikiizi wakeza wavuhuzi waidi, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />wakamba, “Mntu uyu kagombeka, ‘Nadaha kuituwa Nyumba ya Muungu na kuizenga kwa misi mitatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mviki mkuu akagooka na kumuuza Yesu, “Wee khuna chakutambaisa kwa aya wagombekayo wantu awa?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Iya Yesu yee khekuandua dodose. Mviki mkuu akamwamba, “Nakuahiza kwa Muungu wa ugima, tambe ati wee nee Klistu, Mwana wa Muungu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Inga wekugombekavyo miye nee uyo. Iya nawamba, kuvokea isasa mwendammuone Mwana wa Mntu kekaa phande ya kuume ya yuda mwenye udaho, akeza uwanga ya mazunde ya uwanga kwa Muungu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Aho mviki mkuu akatatua gwanda dakwe akamba, “Kambea Muungu takunda wavuhuzi wani vituhu? Nywie wenye mtegeeza ekumbeavyo Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Nywie mwaona viivihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Wowo wakamtambaisa, “Akundigwa auye na nyuma!”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Ahoaho wakamswiiya ovu mwe cheni na watuhu wakamtoa ngumi na watuhu vibao, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />wakamwamba, ati wee nee klistu “Otea! Ni ndai mwekukutoa!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amuemea Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maliko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Kisingi Petulo nekekaa chongoi he buha. Mndima yumwe wa kivyee wa Mviki Mkuu akamwezea na kumwamba, “Wee namba ne uhamwe na Yesu wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Petulo akaemea hemeso ya wose akamba, “Khimanya wagombeka mbwai.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Ekuwaho akalawa he uvi, mndima mtuhu wa kivyee ekumwonaho, akawamba wada wekuwao hada, “Mntu uyu nekawa na Yesu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Petulo akaemea vituhu kwa kuaha, “Khimmanya mntu uyo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Kisingi kidogo, wantu wekuwao hada wakambasa Petulo na kumwamba, “Ata wee, ni yumwe yao, kwaviya ata viya ugombekavyo kwakumanyisa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Aho Petulo akavoka kweswiiya ute na kweahiza na kugombeka, “Khimmanya mntu uyo!” Ahoaho zogoo akakema, <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />aho Petulo akaikumbuka ida mbui ekwembigwayo ni Yesu, “Zogoo khadizati kukema wenda uniemee maa ntatu.” Aho akalawa chongoi na akavoka kuiya kwa usungu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maliko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Kwekuchaho wagookezi wa Waviki wose na waongoezi wa Wayahudi wakakintana vituhu ili wagosoe nteganyi wadahe kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Wakamzengeteza phingu na kumwegaa kwa Pilato, mwekuwa mgookezi wa Kilumi.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya na nyuma kwa Yuda Isikaliote</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Ntendwa 1:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yuda Isikaliote mwekumhituka Yesu, ekuonaho Yesu kabindakae kuamuiwa, akamema usungu na akawavuzia wagookezi wa waviki wakuu zia ntii za makumi matatu ya madini ya feza. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Akawamba, “Khikoa masa kwa kumlavya mntu mwesekuwa na masa yoyose akomwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Iya wowo wakamtambaisa, “Yatiambiiza mbwai swie? Ivyo umanye wee mwenye!”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Nee atambika zia ntii za madini ya feza he nyumba ya Muungu na kulawa chongoi na kuita kwetungika.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Waviki wakuu wakadoa zia ntii za madini za feza wakamba, “Khaifaa kuika hamwe madini aya ya feza na madini yalavigwayo mwe Nyumba ya Muungu kwaviya ntii izi za madini ya feza zilavigwa kwaajii ya kumkoma mntu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Wekubindaho kumamakhanya wakevana kugua mnda wa kiongo hawe hantu hauzisi ha wanyika. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Nee mana adi ivyeo mnda uwo wetangwa mnda wa phome.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Nee yaigania ida mbui yekwegombekwayo na Muoni Yelemia, kuwa, “Wakadoa ziya ntii za makumi matatu ya madini ya feza, yombe yekupangwayo na wantu wa Isilaeli, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />wakaziguiya mnda wa kiongo, inga Zumbe ekuniagiiavyo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hemeso ya Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maliko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu ekuwaho kagooka hemeso ya Pilato ekuwaye mgookezi wa Kilumi, akamuuza, “Wee nee Seuta wa Wayahudi?” Yesu akagombeka, “Inga wekugombekavyo miye nee uyo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Iya wagookezi wa waviki na wadaa wekumwahiavyo masa khekutambaisa mbui.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Ivyo Pilato akamuuza, “Ivi khutegeeza mbui ambazo wazigombeka?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Iya Yesu khekuandua ata mbui mwenga, ata uyo mgookezi wa Kilumi akahondomaa muno.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aamuiwa kukomwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yohana 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Neiwa kawaida kisingi cha sikukhuu ya Pasaka mgookezi wa Kilumi awavugwiiya zumwezumwe da wantu mfungwa yumwe wamkundae. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Kisingi icho nekuwa na mfungwa yumwe ekuwaye mntu mfyaimi, zina dakwe Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ivyo wantu wekukintanikaho hamwe, Pilato akawauza, “Mwakunda ni wavugwiiye yuhi gatigati ya awa waidi, Balaba hambu Yesu etangwae Klistu?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Kagombeka ivyo, kwaviya kamanya wamueta kwakwe kwaajii ya kinyuu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilato ekuwaho kekaa mwe kigoda chakwe cha kuamuiya, mkaziwe akamwetea bauwa inu. “Usekumgosoa kintu chochose mntu uyu yedi, na kwaviya ivyeo khisuumizwa muno mwe sozi kwaajii yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Iya waviki wakuu na wadaa wakawanchochea dia zumwezumwe da wantu wamwombeze Balaba aekewe na Yesu akomwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pilato akawauza, “Gatigati ya awa waidi ni yuhi mumkundae niwavugwiiye?” Wakatambaisa, “Balaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato akawauza, “Isasa mwaonda nimtende viivihi na Yesu mwetangwae Klistu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Wose wakagombeka, “Agong'ondewe he mhamba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato akawauza, “Kwa mbwai? Ni ufyaimi wani ekugosoao?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Wowo wakaendeea kutoa mgutio, “Agong'ondewe he mhamba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilato ekuonaho kuwa khadaha kugosoa dodose na kwaviya khumbizi zavoka kulawiiya, akadoa mazi na akasunta mikono hemeso ya dia zumwezumwe da wantu, akamba, “Mie khimo mwe mbui ya kumkoma mntu uyu, mbwii yenu wenye.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Wantu wose wakamba, “Kwa mbui inu tiigosoayo, Muungu na atekhe sugusa swie hamwe na wana wetu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Aho Pilato akawavuguiya Balaba kulawa he kifungo, na akagombeka Yesu atoigwe na ngoda yekwegosolwayo na babu da kiboko, na akamlavya agong'ondewe he mhamba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asikai wamhega Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maliko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-3">Yohana 19:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Wakamwegaa gati mwe nyumba ya ugookezi, na maasikai wose wakamzunguka. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Wakamhambua gwanda dakwe, wakamhasika joho dekhundu. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Wakagosoa kintu inga khofia seuta yekugosolwayo na miwa wakamhasika mwe mtwi, wakamwiikia ngoda mwe mkono wakwe kuume. Wakakinta mavindi hemeso yakwe, wakambea kwa kumwamba, “Takuugusa Seuta wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Wakamswiiya ovu, wakadoa ida ngoda wekumwekhayo mwe mkono wakwe na kumtoa nayo mwe mtwi <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Wekubindaho kumgosoeya ayo, wakamhambua dia gwanda na kumhasika nguo zakwe, na wakamwegaa kumgong'ondea mwe mhamba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agong'ondewa he mhamba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Wekuwaho wakaita kumng'ondea he mhamba wakamuona mntu yumwe zina dakwe Simoni, mwenyezi wa Kilene. Aho asikai wa Wakilumi wakamshuutiza kuudoa mhamba wakwe Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Wekubuaho hantu hetangwaho Goligota mana yakwe, hantu hafufu da mtwi, <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />wakamwekha divai yekuhanganywayo na nyongo. Iya Yesu ekuionjaho akaemea kuidomea. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Wakamgong'ondea he mhamba, naho nguo zakwe wakapangana kwa kuzitoea kula <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Wakekaa, wakawa wamuinda. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Uwanga ya mtwi wakwe kwe mhamba nee kuikwa kibao chekuandikwacho, “Uyu ni Yesu, Zumbe wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Viyaviya mabagaa waidi nee wagong'ondewa kia yumwe na mhamba wakwe, yumwe phande ya kuume na mtuhu phande ya kumoso.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Wantu wekuwao wakemboka hehi na aho wakamdumua na kusingisa mitwi yao kwa kumseka na kugombeka, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Wee kwevuna, wadaha kuitua Nyumba ya Muungu na kuizenga kwa misi mitatu! Inga wee ni Mwana wa Muungu, eohoe mwenye na usee mwenye kulawa aho he mhamba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Viyaviya, wagookezi wa waviki na wahinyi wa miko na waongoezi wa Wayahudi wakamhega na kugombeka. <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Kawaohoa watuhu, akini kweohoa mwenye khadaha! Ati yee ni Seuta wa wantu wa Isilaeli! Na asee mwe mhamba, na swie tenda timzumiiye! <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Kamkauwiya Muungu, na isasa Muungu amwoohoe inga amkunda, kwaviya kagombeka, ‘Mie ni Mwana wa Muungu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Ata wada wahokaji wekugong'ondewao hamwe nae wakamdumua viyaviya.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auya na nyuma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kuvokea saa mtandatu, musi adi saa kenda, si yose nenikiza du. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Yekubuaho saa kenda Yesu akaiya kwa mgutio mkuu, “Eloi, Eloi, Lama sabakitani?” Yaani, “Muungu yangu, Muungu yangu, mbona kunibada?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Iya wantu wada wekugookao hada wekutegeezaho ivyo wakagombeka, “Amwetanga Elia.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Yumwe awo akaguuka na akadoa dodoki akadiginta mwe divai yekusasayo, akaiika uwanga ya lasi, na akamwekha adomee.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Watuhu wakagombeka, “Eka tikauwe ati Elia endaeze kumwoohoa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Naho Yesu akaiya vituhu kwa mgutio mkuu na akauya na nyuma.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ahoaho pazia da Nyumba ya Muungu dikatatuka ntii mbii, kulawa uwanga hadi asi, na inusi ikazingiza na maiwe makuu yakabondekabondeka, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />mambiya yakavuguka na wantu wa Muungu wakayuyuswa. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Bada ya kuyuyuka kwakwe Yesu, wakalawa mwe mambiya na wakengia mzi wa Muungu na wantu wangi wakawaona.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Yuda mkuu wa maasikai hamwe na weziwe wekuwao wakamuinda Yesu wekuonaho zingizo da inusi na zia mbui zekulawiiazo wakaogoha muno na wakagombeka kwei, “Mntu uyu neekawa Mwana wa Muungu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Hantu aho newaaho wavyee wangi wakamkauwa kwa hae. Awo nee wada wekumtongeao Yesu kulawa Galilaya wakamwambiiza. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Gatigati yao nee ni Maliamu mntu wa Magidala na Maliamu mami yao da Yakobo na Yusufu, hamwe na mami yao wana wa Zebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uzisi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Yekubuaho guoni, akeza mntu yumwe mwenye vintu vingi zina dakwe Yusufu mwenyezi wa mzi wa Alimataya. Yee naye nekawa mhina wa Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />akambasa Pilato akauombeza mwii wa Yesu. Aho Pilato akamba ekhigwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yusufu akaudoa uda mwii akauzengeteza sanda yekung'aayo muno, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />akauiika mwe mbia dihya ekudisongoado mwe iwe kuu, akadoa iwe kuu na kudiika he uvi, na akahauka zakwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maliamu mntu wa Magidala na Maliamu yuda mtuhu, newekaa kukauwa mbia da Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiya daindwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Kioi yakwe, yaani Msi wa Kuhumwiiza, Waviki wakuu na Mafalisayo wakambasa Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />wakamwamba, “Mkuu tikumbuka kuwa, ‘Yuda mtiizi katigombeka, kisingi khazati kuuya na nyuma, bada misi mitatu nendaniyuyuke.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Kwaiyo agiiya ido mbiya diindwe adi misi mitatu ili wahina wakwe wasekweza kumbawa, na kuwamba wantu kayuyuka. Uhokho hunu wa kisikiizi wendauwe wa ufyaimi muno kusima uda wa bosi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato akawamba. “Haya, mnao waindaji na waite mkadiinde mmanyavyo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ivyo wakaita na wagoji ili kudiinda dia mbia vitana, na wakaika alama mwe dia mbia na aho waika asikali wainde.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kuyuyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maliko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Wekwembokaho Msi wa Kuhumwiiza na yekubuwaho keo muno msi wa Jumapili. Maliamu mntu wa Magidala na yuda Maliamu mtuhu wakaita kudikauwa dia mbia. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Vuu puu, kukalawiiya zingizo kuu da inusi mndima wa Zumbe akaseeya kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu akaditongoosa dia iwe na akadekaiya. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Akoonekana inga umweko na nguo zakwe nezing'aa chwee. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Wagoji wa dia mbiya wakakama kwa ukeng'enta mkuu wakawa inga wekuuyao na nyuma.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Iya yuda mndima wa uwanga kwa Muungu akawamba wada wavyee, “Nyie mwesekuogoha! Namanya mwa mwondeza Yesu mwekugong'ondewa he mhamba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Hanu khayuho kwaviya kayuyuka inga ekugombekavyo. Sooni mhakauwe hantu hekuwaho mwii wakwe ugonezwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Naho hitani kinyionyio mkawambe wahina wakwe kuwa kayuyuka na isasa awaongoeya kuita Galilaya, uko mwendamumwone. Aya miye khigombeka kae.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Awo wavyee wakahauka hada he mbiya uku wamema ukeng'enta na nyemi muno, wakaita uku waguuka wakawambe wahina wakwe mbui iyo.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Vuu puu, Yesu akakintana nawo akagombeka, “Mwaona vihi.” Awo wavyee wakamtimia na kukinta mavindi hemeso yakwe wakatoza miundi yakwe wakavika. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Nee Yesu awamba, “Mwesekuogoha! Hitani mkawambe wandugu zangu waite Galilaya na uko wenda wanione.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagoji waita kugombeka yada wekuyaonayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Kisingi wada wavyee wekuwaho wakaita zao siai, wamwe na wamwe wa asikai wekuwao wainda mbiya wakaita mwe mzi na kuwatamwiiziya wagookezi wa waviki kia kintu chekulawiiacho. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Awo wagookezi wa waviki kukintana hamwe na waongoezi wa Wayahudi na kugosoa nteganyi yao, na wakawekha wada asikai hea nyingi muno, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />wakawamba, “Nywie mwenda mgombeke ivi, ‘Wahina wakwe nee weza na kio, wakaudoa mwii wakwe kisingi swie nee tigona.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Inga mbui izi zikambwiiya mgookezi Pilato swie tendatigombeke nae na nywie khamnampate tatizo dodose.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Wada wagoji wakazidoa zia hea inga wekuhinywavyo. Mbui iyo ikaambazika gatigati ya Wayahudi hadi ivyeo.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalawiiya wahina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ntendwa 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Wada wahina kumi dimwe na mwenga wakaita Galilaya kwe uda muima inga ekuwaagiiavyo Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Akini watuhu newawa khawazumiiya kuwa kwei nee ni Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu akeza hehi na kuwamba, “Nchekhigwa udaho wose wa uko uwanga kwa Muungu na mwe inusi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Hitani mkawagosoe wantu wa si zose wawe wahina wangu, mkawabatiiza kwa zina da Tate na da Mwana na Muye wa Muungu. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Wahinyeni kutoza miagiiyo yangu nikuwekhayo. Na miye ni hamwe na nywie misi yose, adi kisingi cha kisikiizi.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>